#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/enable_banking.rst:291
msgid "The session expired or was closed or revoked at the bank. The connection is set to :guilabel:`Expired`: click :guilabel:`Renew consent`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/enable_banking.rst:293
msgid "*The bank consent expired on ... Renew it on the connection.*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/enable_banking.rst:294
msgid "Same as above; Odoo stopped calling the bank when the consent ended."
