#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/batch_bank_transfers.rst:113
msgid "You can also work from the list of vendor bills at any time: the :guilabel:`Bank Transfer` column shows whether a bill has been sent to the bank (:guilabel:`Not Sent`, :guilabel:`Partially Sent` or :guilabel:`Fully Sent`). Enable it with the optional columns selector if it is hidden."
