#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/batch_bank_transfers.rst:137
msgid "The :guilabel:`Transferred Amount` is what has already been sent to the bank for the bill in other approved batches. A line is shown in **red** when its amount and the transferred amount exceed the total of the bill, and in **orange** when the bill has no vendor bank account. The search box above the list filters the lines."
