msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/follow_up.rst:5
msgid "Follow-up messages can be sent to customers when payments are overdue. eYssen ERP helps identify late payments and lets you schedule and send the appropriate reminders using **follow-up levels** according to the number of overdue days. Reminders can be sent through several channels: email, SMS, postal letter, an online **Pay Now** link, and scheduled activities."
