msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/assets.rst:38
msgid "Asset categories define how the assets are recorded and depreciated. To create one, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Management --> Asset Category` and click :guilabel:`New`. Fill in the following fields:"
