msgid "In this example it can be determined that :guilabel:`Mike Smith` has the highest amount of expenses, totaling :guilabel:`4,216.44`. This is almost seven times higher than :guilabel:`Ronnie Hart`, who has the second highest expenses, with a total of :guilabel:`644.74`."
