#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses/expenses_analysis.rst:78
msgid "In this example, it can be determined that the company spent the most on travel expenses, with the expense category :guilabel:`[TRANS & ACC] Travel & Accommodation` incurring :guilabel:`2,940.00` of expenses for the year. The company reimbursed mileage the least, with only :guilabel:`229.69` in :guilabel:`[MIL] Mileage` expenses."
