#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:192
msgid "If the domain alias needs to be set up, :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Setup your domain alias` appears beneath the :guilabel:`Incoming Emails` checkbox, instead of the email address field."
