#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:205
msgid "To submit an expense via email, create a new email, and enter the product's *reference* code (if available) and the amount of the expense as the subject of the email. Next, attach the receipt to the email. Odoo creates the expense by taking the information in the email subject, and combining it with the receipt."
