#: ../../content/applications/finance/expenses/reimburse.rst:73
msgid ":guilabel:`Recipient Bank Account`: This field only appears if the :guilabel:`Journal` is set to :guilabel:`Bank`. The employee's :ref:`bank account <employees/private-info>` populates this field, by default. If the employee has more than one trusted bank account on their employee profile, use the drop-down menu to select the desired bank account."
