msgid "Odoo allows companies under the `Deferred Goods and Services Tax (DGST) scheme <https://www.ato.gov.au/businesses-and-organisations/gst-excise-and-indirect-taxes/gst/in-detail/rules-for-specific-transactions/international-transactions/deferred-gst?=redirected_deferredGSTscheme>`_ to automate their deferred GST flows."
msgstr ""

