#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:318
msgid "To access closings, either go to :menuselection:`Point of Sales --> Reporting --> Sales Closings` or :menuselection:`Invoicing/Accounting --> Reporting --> Sales Closings`."
