#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/epr.rst:160
msgid "A customer who ships at least 60% of the products abroad (22. §), or who uses frying oil or fat as raw material (22/A. §), can declare it. Sales covered by the declaration are reported with obligation code `A` or `B`, without fee, and the declaring customer is listed in the data report."
