msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/epr.rst:183
msgid "When an invoice is posted, a register line is created for every EPR component of its products: quantity = invoiced quantity converted to the unit of the product × weight per unit, fee = quantity × rate valid on the fulfillment date. The lines are shown on the :guilabel:`EPR` tab of the invoice (visible to invoicing users and accountants)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/epr.rst:188
msgid "Deliveries abroad (shipping address outside Hungary) are not reportable (16. § (4))."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/epr.rst:189
msgid "Sales covered by an effective customer declaration are reported without fee, with obligation code `A` or `B`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/epr.rst:191
msgid "With the stock-in method, purchases from Hungarian suppliers are not reportable unless the product is :guilabel:`Always liable`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/epr.rst:193
msgid "Credit notes reverse the lines of the original invoice in proportion to the credited quantity, with the same KF code, rate and declaration. If a credit note or a corrective invoice only corrects the price, tick :guilabel:`No EPR Effect` on it; the field can also be changed after posting."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/epr.rst:196
msgid "If the EPR components of a product are completed later, select the posted invoices in the list view and use :menuselection:`Actions --> Rebuild EPR lines` (accounting administrators). Lines of a closed data report are not changed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/epr.rst:201
msgid "Only invoices create register lines. Point of Sale orders without an invoice, foreign packaging removed in Hungary (own use, origin code `8`, 17. § (3)) and the opening inventory of the stock-in method are entered as manual lines in the EPR register."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/epr.rst:206
