#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/epr.rst:215
msgid "*A kiterjesztett gyártói felelősségi díj megfizetésre kerül.* if the customer asked for it and no other clause applies (21. § (5))."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/epr.rst:218
msgid "With the stock-in method, the clause of 21. § (2) is printed on the domestic sales of the products with EPR components."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/epr.rst:224
msgid "EPR fee in the expected cost"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/epr.rst:226
msgid "With *Supplier Product Management* installed, the module :guilabel:`Supplier Product Management - Hungarian EPR` (`supplier_product_management_l10n_hu_epr`) is installed automatically. It fills the :guilabel:`EPR Fee per Unit` of the vendor pricelist lines from the EPR components of the product: weight per unit × current rate of the fee code, summed over the components and converted to the unit of the pricelist line. The fee becomes part of the :ref:`expected cost <inventory/supplier-products/expected-cost>` of the line."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/epr.rst:233
msgid "The fee is filled only when the company pays it for goods bought from that vendor, following the same rules as the register:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/epr.rst:236
msgid "no fee if the EPR register is not active or the product's :guilabel:`EPR Liability` is :guilabel:`Not liable (another company placed it on the market)`;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/epr.rst:238
msgid "with :guilabel:`Always liable`, or with the placing-on-the-market method, the fee is always counted;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/epr.rst:240
msgid "with the stock-in method, the fee is counted for vendors abroad, not for Hungarian vendors."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/epr.rst:242
msgid "The fee is recalculated when the vendor, the product or its EPR components change; it can be overwritten by hand on the line."
msgstr ""

