msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/epr.rst:261
msgid "Create a report with the year and the quarter. The :guilabel:`Deadline` (20th day of the month after the quarter) is shown."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/epr.rst:263
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Compute`. The register lines of the quarter are summed by KF code:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/epr.rst:265
msgid "deliveries in the :guilabel:`Summary` tab as *placed on the market* rows (data package block `KG_KGYF_NE_TERMEK_FORG`), with the declaring buyers of the `A` and `B` codes;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/epr.rst:267
msgid "credit notes as *returned* rows with positive quantities (block `KG_KGYF_NE_TERMEK_VISSZA`);"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/epr.rst:268
msgid "the :guilabel:`Expected Fee` tab: quantity × rate by fee code and rate, net of the returns."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/epr.rst:270
msgid "Quantities are in kg with three decimals; codes netting to zero are left out. Without any line the report is a :guilabel:`Zero Report`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/epr.rst:272
msgid "Check the warnings: draft invoices of the quarter, lines of earlier quarters that are in no report (late credit notes), returned products, missing rates, declarations without buyer address, Point of Sale orders without invoice, and missing OKIRkapu data."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/epr.rst:275
msgid ":guilabel:`Export XML (OKIRkapu)` computes the draft report again, builds the :guilabel:`KG:KGYF-NÉ` XML and validates it against the official XSD (version 1.16). :guilabel:`Export XLSX` downloads the summary, the expected fee and the detailed register."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/epr.rst:278
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Close`: the register lines of the quarter are locked."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/epr.rst:279
msgid "In OKIRkapu, create the data package with :guilabel:`Új adatcsomag XML-ből`, upload the XML, check it and submit it. Record :guilabel:`Submitted On` and :guilabel:`OKIR Filing Number`, then click :guilabel:`Mark as Submitted`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/epr.rst:282
msgid "When the MOHU invoice arrives, add it to :guilabel:`MOHU Invoices` in the :guilabel:`Expected Fee` tab: :guilabel:`Invoiced by MOHU (net)` and :guilabel:`Difference` show the comparison. A complaint with the correct data can be filed within 15 days of receipt (21. § (7))."
