msgid "Corrections"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/epr.rst:297
msgid "The data of a submitted quarter can be corrected once a year, between 1 January and 31 March of the following year, or with a complaint against the MOHU invoice within 15 days (27. § (6), 21. § (7)). Create a new report for the quarter with :guilabel:`Correction` ticked and fill in :guilabel:`Disputed MOHU Invoice` or :guilabel:`Authority Case Number`. The correction takes a snapshot of all register lines of the quarter; the lines stay linked to the original report."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/epr.rst:304
msgid "The following cases are not supported by the module: the yearly report of small producers (`KG:KGYF-ÉV`), take-over contracts, deposit-return (DRS) products, the lump sum for wine bottles and vehicles, and the handling data of individual fulfillment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/evat.rst:3
msgid "VAT return with NAV eÁFA (eVAT M2M)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/evat.rst:5
msgid "The :guilabel:`Hungary - eVAT (eÁFA M2M) VAT Return` (`l10n_hu_evat`) module files the Hungarian VAT return through the *eÁFA* machine-to-machine interface of NAV instead of an ÁNYK form. Odoo builds the VAT **analytics** of the period from the posted journal entries (one line per source document, classified with the *standard tax codes* of NAV), validates them with the rules and the XML schema published by NAV, uploads them in the background, follows the processing at NAV, and finally an approver submits the legally binding return. Self-revisions and corrections of submitted returns are supported."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/evat.rst:14
msgid "The module requires `eyssen_l10n_hu` and uses the technical user of the :doc:`NAV Online Számla reporting <nav_online_invoice>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/evat.rst:16
msgid "Returns can only be generated for companies whose currency is HUF."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/evat.rst:17
msgid "The module is independent of the :doc:`ÁNYK form packages <vat_return>`; use one of the two methods for a given period. The domestic recapitulative M sheets and the EC recapitulative statement (`A60`) are not part of this module: the partner-level data travel in the analytics lines, and the recapitulative statement is prepared with the ÁNYK form package."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/evat.rst:28
