msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/kvtd.rst:3
msgid "Environmental product fee (KVTD)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/kvtd.rst:5
msgid "The :guilabel:`Hungary - Environmental Product Charge (KVTD)` (`l10n_hu_kvtd`) module keeps the register of the environmental product fee (*környezetvédelmi termékdíj*, Act LXXXV of 2011, Ktdt.), prints the required clauses on the invoices and prepares the quarterly summary of the NAV :guilabel:`KTBEV` return. It can be installed from the Apps menu or by ticking :guilabel:`Hungarian KVTD` in the :doc:`eYssen ERP settings <../../../general/eyssen_erp_settings>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/kvtd.rst:11
msgid "Since 1 January 2025 the product fee only applies to three product streams; packaging, electrical and electronic equipment, batteries, tyres, office paper and advertising paper are covered by the :doc:`extended producer responsibility (EPR) <epr>` instead:"
