msgid "**other petroleum products**: lubricating, hydraulic and industrial oils (KT groups `602`, `603`, `604`);"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/kvtd.rst:17
msgid "**other plastic products**: artificial flowers and plants (`301`) and plastic carrier bags (`311`, `312`, `316`, `351`, `352`, by thickness and biodegradability);"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/kvtd.rst:19
msgid "**other chemical products**: soaps, detergents and cleaning products (`701`) and cosmetics (`702`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/kvtd.rst:22
msgid "The fee does not change the price, the taxes or the journal entry of the invoice. The module keeps the register and the summary; the return itself is filed on the :guilabel:`KTBEV` form of NAV."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/kvtd.rst:25
msgid "The module replaces the earlier `eyssen_l10n_hu_kvtd` module. See :ref:`Changing from the earlier module <localizations/hungary/kvtd-migration>`."
