#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/kvtd.rst:242
msgid "Check the warnings: draft invoices of the period, lines without rate, negative balances, lines of earlier periods that are in no return (for example late credit notes, which belong to their own period), Point of Sale orders without invoice, and the yearly limit of the lump sum (40 kg petroleum products, 2 kg artificial flowers, 75 kg carrier bags, 200 kg chemical products)."
