#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/proforma.rst:56
msgid ":guilabel:`Összeg típusa` (amount type): :guilabel:`Százalék` (percentage of the order total) or :guilabel:`Összeg` (fixed amount, the default);"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/proforma.rst:58
msgid ":guilabel:`Érték` (value): defaults to the gross total of the order; it cannot exceed 100% or the order total;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/proforma.rst:60
msgid ":guilabel:`Fizetési határidő (nap)` (payment deadline in days, 2 by default): the due date is today plus this number of days;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/proforma.rst:62
msgid ":guilabel:`Tételek hozzáadása` (add items): lists the products of the order as notes under the advance line; the notes are copied to the advance invoice as well."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/proforma.rst:65
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Kiállítás`. A draft pro-forma invoice opens with the customer, currency, payment terms, customer reference and bank account of the order, and a single line *Down payment* (translated to the language of the customer) for the requested gross amount with the taxes of the order lines. :ref:`Cash rounding <localizations/hungary/payment-terms>` is applied automatically."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/proforma.rst:70
msgid "The :guilabel:`Delivery Address` of the pro-forma invoice is the customer's default delivery address. The printed pro-forma invoice shows the customer address only."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/proforma.rst:82
msgid "Only one open pro-forma invoice can exist for an order: while a confirmed, unpaid pro-forma invoice exists, a new one can only be created after the previous one is cancelled. The :guilabel:`Díjbekérők` smart button of the sales order opens the related pro-forma invoices."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/proforma.rst:89
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Pro Forma Invoices` and click :guilabel:`New` to create a pro-forma invoice that is not linked to a sales order. Fill in the customer, the payment terms or due date, the :guilabel:`Bankszámla` (company bank account, mandatory) and the lines."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/proforma.rst:94
msgid "Most field labels of the pro-forma invoice form are displayed in Hungarian in the current module version: :guilabel:`Ügyfél` (customer), :guilabel:`Díjbekérő dátuma` (date), :guilabel:`Fizetési hivatkozás` (payment reference), :guilabel:`Fizetési feltétel` (payment terms), :guilabel:`Díjbekérő tételek` (lines), :guilabel:`Előlegszámlák` (advance invoices), :guilabel:`Egyéb` (other information)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/proforma.rst:101
msgid "Confirm and send"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/proforma.rst:103
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Confirm`. The pro-forma invoice gets its number and the status *Posted*; no journal entry is created."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/proforma.rst:105
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Send & Print` to e-mail the PDF to the customer with the *Díjbekérő küldése* template (the text of the template is Hungarian), or to download it. :guilabel:`Preview` shows the document as the customer sees it in the portal."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/proforma.rst:109
msgid "The list opens with the :guilabel:`Nincs fizetve` (not paid) filter. The :guilabel:`Fizetés állapota` (payment status) of a pro-forma invoice is *Nincs fizetve* (not paid), *Részben fizetve* (partially paid), *Fizetés folyamatban* (in payment) or *Fizetve* (paid), depending on its advance invoices."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/proforma.rst:114
msgid "A draft or confirmed pro-forma invoice without advance invoice can be withdrawn with :guilabel:`Cancel`; it is then marked with a red :guilabel:`Revoked` ribbon. It cannot be reset to draft."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/proforma.rst:127
msgid "Register the payment and issue the advance invoice"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/proforma.rst:129
msgid "When the money arrives, open the pro-forma invoice and click :guilabel:`Register Payment`. In the dialog (*Előlegszámla kiállítása és fizetés rögzítése*):"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/proforma.rst:132
msgid "adjust the :guilabel:`Bruttó összeg` (gross amount) of the lines if the customer paid only a part of the requested amount. The field is pre-filled with the amount not yet invoiced, so a pro-forma invoice can be paid in several installments;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/proforma.rst:135
msgid "select the :guilabel:`Bank napló` (bank or cash journal of the payment) and the :guilabel:`Számla napló` (sales journal of the advance invoice);"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/proforma.rst:137
msgid "set the :guilabel:`Teljesítés időpontja` (fulfillment date): the day the payment was received;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/proforma.rst:138
msgid "check the payment terms and the payment method;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/proforma.rst:139
msgid "keep or clear the :guilabel:`E-mail sablon` (e-mail template) to send or not to send the advance invoice to the customer (:guilabel:`Számla küldése`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/proforma.rst:142
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Kifizetés rögzítése`. In a single step, Odoo"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/proforma.rst:144
msgid "creates the advance invoice with today's invoice date and the given fulfillment and accounting date, with lines named after the pro-forma lines and the pro-forma number;"
