#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/proforma.rst:149
msgid "e-mails the paid advance invoice to the customer, if an e-mail template was selected."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/proforma.rst:151
msgid "When the pro-forma invoice comes from a sales order, the advance invoice takes the :guilabel:`Delivery Address` selected on that order. A delivery address changed later on the pro-forma invoice stays on the pro-forma invoice. The fiscal position of the advance invoice remains the fiscal position of the pro-forma invoice. A pro-forma invoice created without a sales order uses the customer's default delivery address on the advance invoice as well."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/proforma.rst:158
msgid "The advance invoices are listed in the :guilabel:`Előlegszámlák` tab of the pro-forma invoice, and the pro-forma invoice is shown in the :guilabel:`Díjbekérő` field of the :guilabel:`Related Invoices` tab of the advance invoice."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/proforma.rst:171
msgid "Final invoice"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/proforma.rst:173
msgid "Invoice the sales order as usual with :guilabel:`Create Invoice` once the goods are delivered or the service is performed. The advance invoices are deducted automatically; see :ref:`advance and final invoices <localizations/hungary/corrective>` for the option limiting the deduction."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/proforma.rst:177
msgid "The final invoice takes the :guilabel:`Delivery Address` of the sales order."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/proforma.rst:180
msgid "Reports and customer portal"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/proforma.rst:182
msgid "Two PDF reports are available in the :guilabel:`Print` menu: :guilabel:`Proformas` and :guilabel:`Proformas without Payment`. The document is titled *Pro Forma Invoice* (*Draft* or *Cancelled Pro Forma Invoice*) and shows the tax numbers of the customer, the dates, the payment method, the bank account and payment reference, the lines with net, VAT and gross amounts, and the exchange rate for foreign-currency documents."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/hungary/proforma.rst:188
msgid "Customers receive a secure link to the pro-forma invoice in the e-mail and can view and print it in the portal. Online payment of pro-forma invoices is not available."
