msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/kenya.rst:84
msgid "every line has exactly one VAT tax, and a 0 % or exempt tax has a KRA item code."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/kenya.rst:86
msgid "After the device has signed the document, the :guilabel:`Kenya CU Invoice Number` is filled in and the :guilabel:`Tremol GO3 Fiscal Device` tab of the invoice shows the :guilabel:`CU QR Code`, :guilabel:`CU Serial Number` and :guilabel:`CU Signing Date and Time`. These details and the QR code are printed on the invoice PDF."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/kenya.rst:102
msgid "For tax-exempt customers, enter their :guilabel:`Exemption Number` in the :guilabel:`Kenya Accounting Details` section of the contact form (Sales & Purchase tab); it is transmitted to the device with the invoice."
msgstr ""

