msgid "The documents supported on customer invoices are: Invoice (*Factura*), *Boleta*, Debit Note and Credit Note. The document type proposed on an invoice depends on the customer's identification type: a customer with a RUC gets a *Factura*, other customers a *Boleta*."
msgstr ""

