#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/cash.rst:168
msgid "The amounts are in the currency of the company. Set a limit to zero to disable it. The defaults are the limits set by GEO 115/2023, which Law 239/2025 (in force since 1 January 2026) did not change. They are not updated automatically: check them with the accountant of the company and adapt them if the law changes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/cash.rst:174
msgid "How the limits are checked"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/cash.rst:176
msgid "Each time a cash payment is posted or a cash line is recorded, Odoo adds up, for the partner and the day of the operation, the operations of **all the cash journals of the company** on that day (cancelled vouchers excluded), converted into the currency of the company. A contact that is a company is a legal entity; any other contact is an individual. The partner is the commercial entity of the contact."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/cash.rst:182
msgid "With the :guilabel:`Warn` policy, a :guilabel:`Cash limit` warning is displayed on the form while you enter the operation, and a note is posted in the chatter of the voucher and of the payment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/cash.rst:184
msgid "With the :guilabel:`Block` policy, the operation is refused with an error message that gives the date, the partner, the total and the limit."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/cash.rst:186
msgid "The cash ceiling never blocks anything. When the cash on hand of the company (the balance of the cash accounts of its cash journals in the currency of the company) is above the ceiling at the end of a day, a note recommends depositing the excess in a bank account within two working days. The cash register book prints a warning for the days concerned."
msgstr ""

