#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:5
msgid "D300 VAT return and e-TVA"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:7
msgid "The :guilabel:`Romania - D300 VAT Return (Decont de TVA)` (`l10n_ro_d300`) module prepares the Romanian VAT return, form **D300** (*Decont de taxă pe valoarea adăugată*), in the model of **OPANAF 174/2026**, which applies to the periods from January 2026. The return is computed from the posted journal items of the period, validated, and exported as the XML file that is filed with :abbr:`ANAF (Agenția Națională de Administrare Fiscală)`. The module also compares the return with the pre-filled VAT return that ANAF prepares for the taxpayer in the **RO e-TVA** system."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:14
msgid "This page describes the specific features of the D300. The general flow of the Romanian declarations (statuses, deadlines, DUK validation, filing) is described in :doc:`declarations`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:21
msgid ":ref:`Install <general/install>` the :guilabel:`Romania - D300 VAT Return (Decont de TVA)` module. Then check, in :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings`, section :guilabel:`Romanian ANAF Declarations` (see :ref:`localizations/romania/declarations/configuration`):"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:25
msgid "the **declarant** (last name, first name, position): mandatory;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:26
msgid "the **main CAEN code** of the company: 4 digits, mandatory;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:27
msgid "the **VAT period** of the company, which is proposed as the period type of new returns;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:28
msgid "the **bank account** printed on the return, with a bank name: the D300 requires the bank and the account number. If the field is empty, the first bank account of the company is used;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:30
msgid "the :guilabel:`Tax ID` of the company, with the `RO` prefix if the company is registered for VAT."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:32
msgid "The taxes used on the invoices must belong to the Romanian chart of accounts or be linked to a :ref:`Romanian tax code <localizations/romania/declarations/configuration>`, otherwise their amounts cannot be placed in a row of the return."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:37
msgid "The taxes with a partial deduction (for example, 50% for vehicles) are handled as described in :doc:`nondeductible_vat`. The return reports the full VAT of these purchases in the purchase rows 20 to 28 and subtracts the non-deductible part in row 31."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:42
msgid "Prepare the VAT return"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:44
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Romania (ANAF) --> Declarations --> D300 VAT Return` and click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:46
msgid "Set the :guilabel:`Period Type` (:guilabel:`Month`, :guilabel:`Quarter`, :guilabel:`Semester` or :guilabel:`Year`), the :guilabel:`Year` and the :guilabel:`Period` number. The form shows the dates of the period and the :guilabel:`Deadline` (the 25th of the following month, moved to the next working day)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:50
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Compute`. The :guilabel:`Rows` tab is filled in, and the findings are listed in the :guilabel:`Validation` tab."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:52
msgid "Review the rows (see below) and fill in the data that cannot be computed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:53
msgid "Optionally, :ref:`reconcile the return with RO e-TVA <localizations/romania/d300/etva>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:54
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Validate`, then :guilabel:`Export XML`, file the return, and click :guilabel:`Mark as Submitted`, as described in :doc:`declarations`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:58
msgid "A new return for a period before January 2026 can be computed, but it cannot be validated or exported: the module contains the D300 model of OPANAF 174/2026 only. Periods before 2026 must be filed with the model in force at the time."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:63
msgid "How the rows are computed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:65
msgid "The return takes the **posted journal items** whose accounting date falls in the period and whose VAT is **exigible**. For the taxes with *VAT on payment* (*TVA la încasare*), the amount is reported through the cash basis entries, in the period of the payment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:69
msgid "For each journal item and tax, Odoo finds the row in this order:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:71
msgid "a **tax mapping rule** of the form D300 that matches the tax;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:72
msgid "otherwise the **D300 tax grids** of the Romanian chart of accounts (for example, `09 - TAX BASE` or `26_1 - VAT`);"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:74
msgid "otherwise the **Romanian tax code** of the tax."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:76
msgid "If none applies, a message with the code `TAX_UNMAPPED` is added and the amount is not reported. The result of every row is rounded to whole lei."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:84
msgid "Treatment"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:85
msgid "Operation rows (for example 1 to 11, 13 to 18, 20 to 25, 29 and 33)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:86
msgid "**Computed** from the accounting. The amounts can be corrected with the adjustment columns."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:87
msgid "Totals: 12, 19, 26, 30, 31, 35, 36, 37, 40, 43, 44, 45"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:88
msgid "**Computed** with the formulas of the form from the other rows. They cannot be edited, except the VAT of row 31 (:guilabel:`VAT Adjustment`). Row 31 is row 30 minus the :guilabel:`Non-deductible VAT` of the period."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:91
msgid "Row 41 (negative balance carried over)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:92
msgid "**Automatic**: row 45 of the previous filed return, if no refund was requested for it. Adjustable."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:94
msgid "Row 38 (VAT payable balance of the previous return not paid at the filing date)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:95
msgid "**Manual**: enter it in the :guilabel:`VAT Adjustment` column."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:96
msgid "Rows 39 and 42 (differences established by the tax authorities by communicated decision)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:97
msgid "**Manual**: enter them in the :guilabel:`VAT Adjustment` column."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:98
msgid "Rows 32 (VAT refunded to foreign buyers) and 34 (pro-rata and capital goods adjustments)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:99
msgid "Not fed by the taxes of the standard chart of accounts: enter them in the :guilabel:`VAT Adjustment` column if they apply."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:101
msgid "Blocks A, A1, B, B1 (VAT on payment: supplies not yet chargeable and purchases whose deduction was not exercised, at the end of the period)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:103
msgid "**Computed** from the open cash basis documents, in the :guilabel:`Supplementary Information` tab. They can be corrected."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:105
msgid "Invoice counters and totals of the :guilabel:`Invoices` group"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:106
msgid "**Manual**, see below."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:108
msgid "The columns of the :guilabel:`Rows` tab are the base (:guilabel:`Base (col. 1)`) and the VAT (:guilabel:`VAT (col. 2)`) of each row, with the :guilabel:`Base Adjustment` and :guilabel:`VAT Adjustment` columns in which you type the manual corrections. The columns :guilabel:`Base (accounting)` and :guilabel:`VAT (accounting)` (hidden by default; use the optional columns menu) show the amounts computed from the accounting before the adjustment. Adjustments are kept when the return is recomputed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:115
msgid "To see where an amount comes from, click the :guilabel:`Audit` button at the top of the return or the magnifier icon at the end of a row: it lists the journal items, taxes and sources (mapping rule, tax grid or tax code) behind the row. The list icon opens the journal items."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:120
msgid "Fill in the data that is not computed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:124
msgid "Rows 32, 34, 38, 39 and 42"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:123
msgid "Type the amounts in the :guilabel:`VAT Adjustment` column of the row. Rows 38 and 41 cannot both be filled in."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:134
msgid "Header data"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:127
msgid "On the :guilabel:`Header` tab, check the :guilabel:`Bank Account`, the :guilabel:`CAEN Code` and the :guilabel:`Deduction Pro Rata (%)` (pro rata of art. 300 of the Fiscal Code; 0 when it does not apply). Tick :guilabel:`Request Refund` to claim the negative balance of row 45 (allowed for a balance of at least 5,000 lei). The :guilabel:`Payment Reference` (*număr de evidență a plății*) is computed. The groups :guilabel:`Reverse Charge Supplies in the Period` and :guilabel:`Special Situations` contain the options of the form, for example :guilabel:`Simplified Method for Domestic Operations`, :guilabel:`Consolidated Return of a Fiscal Group` and :guilabel:`Successor Fiscal Code`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:143
msgid "Invoice counters"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:137
msgid "On the :guilabel:`Supplementary Information` tab, group :guilabel:`Invoices`, enter the number of invoices issued and received and their base and VAT (:guilabel:`Invoices Issued (count)`, :guilabel:`Invoices Issued: Base`, :guilabel:`Invoices Issued: VAT`, and the same for the invoices received), and, if the VAT code was cancelled during the period, the invoices issued in that time. The group :guilabel:`Services to Non-taxable Persons in Other Member States` holds the totals of the previous and of the current year. Odoo does not compute these figures. Those of the first two lines are part of the control sum of the XML file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:148
msgid "The validation of the return includes the rules of ANAF's own checks. The main ones are:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:150
msgid "the **self-assessed rows equal their deductible rows** (for example, row 20 equals row 5 and row 26 equals row 12), and the \"of which\" rows cannot exceed their parent row;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:152
msgid "row 31 cannot exceed row 30, rows 38 and 41 cannot both be filled in, and the refund can be requested only for a negative balance (row 45) of at least 5,000 lei;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:154
msgid "for the rows with a VAT rate (9, 10, 11, 12.1, 12.2, 24, 25, 26.1, 26.2), the VAT must be within the rate +/- 1 percentage point of the base (warning);"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:156
msgid "the bank account, the CAEN code and the declarant must be filled in, and the pro rata must be between 0 and 100;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:158
msgid "a company without the `RO` prefix in its Tax ID gets a warning."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:160
msgid "A rectificative return (:guilabel:`Create Rectificative`) is a new return for the same period with version 2 or more. The D300 XML has no rectification flag: ANAF records a new return for the same period as a correction, so file it as such."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:167
msgid "Reconciliation with RO e-TVA"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:169
msgid "*RO e-TVA* is the ANAF system that prepares, for every VAT payer, a **pre-filled VAT return** (the *P300*) from the data reported by the taxpayer and its partners. ANAF compares it with the return that the taxpayer files. Odoo helps to find the differences **before** the return is filed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:173
msgid "Odoo does not download the pre-filled return from ANAF. Obtain the values yourself, then:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:175
msgid "Compute the return, then click :guilabel:`Import e-TVA` (available when the return is not in the :guilabel:`Draft` status). The :guilabel:`Import RO e-TVA (P300)` window opens."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:177
msgid "Upload the values of the pre-filled return in one of these formats:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:179
msgid "an **XML** file that uses the names of the D300 fields (`R9_1`, `R9_2`...), for example the XML of a D300 or of the P300;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:181
msgid "a **CSV** or text file with one row per line: the row number (`9`, `12.1`, `rd. 26.2`), then the base and the VAT, separated by `;`, `,` or a tab. Header lines are ignored."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:184
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Import`. The values replace those of all the rows: a row that is not in the file is set to zero. A message in the chatter gives the number of rows read and the number of significant differences."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:187
msgid "Click the :guilabel:`e-TVA Differences` button at the top of the return. The reconciliation list shows, for each row, the amount of the return, the :guilabel:`e-TVA Base` and :guilabel:`e-TVA VAT`, and the :guilabel:`Base Difference` and :guilabel:`VAT Difference`. The e-TVA values can also be typed directly in this list."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:192
msgid "A difference is marked as :guilabel:`Significant Difference` (red line) when it reaches **both** 20% and 5,000 lei, measured on the VAT column or, for the rows without VAT, on the base. This is the threshold at which ANAF sends an e-TVA compliance notification, which must be answered within 20 days. Use the filters :guilabel:`Significant Differences` and :guilabel:`Any Difference` to find the rows to check."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d300.rst:198
msgid "For each difference, check the documents behind the row with the audit icon. If the cause is a wrong or missing document, correct the accounting and click :guilabel:`Recompute`; if the return is right, keep the difference and be ready to explain it. The imported e-TVA values are kept when the return is recomputed."
msgstr ""

