msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d390.rst:7
msgid "The :guilabel:`Romania - D390 Recapitulative Statement (VIES)` (`l10n_ro_d390`) module prepares the **D390** (*Declarația recapitulativă privind livrările/achizițiile/prestările intracomunitare*), the monthly statement of the intra-Community operations of the company with VAT payers of other EU member states, in the model of **OPANAF 705/2020**. The operations are grouped by operation type and by partner (country and VAT number), and exported as the XML file filed with :abbr:`ANAF (Agenția Națională de Administrare Fiscală)`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d390.rst:14
msgid "This page describes the specific features of the D390. The general flow of the Romanian declarations (statuses, deadlines, DUK validation, filing) is described in :doc:`declarations`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d390.rst:21
msgid ":ref:`Install <general/install>` the :guilabel:`Romania - D390 Recapitulative Statement (VIES)` module, which installs the :doc:`D300 <d300>` module as a dependency. The company settings are those of the :ref:`declarations <localizations/romania/declarations/configuration>`: the declarant, the company Tax ID and the other data of the section :guilabel:`Romanian ANAF Declarations` in :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d390.rst:27
msgid "The operation type of each operation comes from the **Romanian tax code** of the tax used on the document (field :guilabel:`D390 Operation Type` of the tax code, in :menuselection:`Accounting --> Romania (ANAF) --> Configuration --> Romanian Tax Codes`), or from a :guilabel:`Tax Mapping Rule` of the form D390. For example, use a rule on a fiscal position to report the supplies of a triangular operation with type `T`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d390.rst:39
msgid "`L`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/d390.rst:40
