msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:108
msgid "The company needs a valid :abbr:`CUI (Cod Unic de Identificare, fiscal identification code)` in its :guilabel:`Tax ID` field: the validation checks its control digit. A company whose Tax ID does not start with `RO` is not registered for VAT, and the VAT declarations show a warning."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:115
msgid "The menu :menuselection:`Accounting --> Romania (ANAF)` is displayed to the users who have access to a company whose fiscal country is Romania and who have an accounting access right. Accountants can create and modify the declarations, users with read-only accounting access can only read them, and accounting advisers (managers) can also delete them and edit the configuration. A user only sees the declarations of the companies selected in the company switcher."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:122
msgid "Tax codes and mapping rules"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:124
msgid "The declarations do not read the taxes directly. Every tax of the Romanian chart of accounts is linked to a **Romanian tax code**, which tells each declaration where the operation is reported: the rows of the D300, the operation type of the D390, and so on. The link is the :guilabel:`Romanian Tax Code` field of the tax (:menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Taxes`), which is filled in automatically for the taxes of the Romanian chart of accounts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:130
msgid "Accounting advisers can review and complete the catalogue in :menuselection:`Accounting --> Romania (ANAF) --> Configuration` (this menu is reserved to them):"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:133
msgid ":guilabel:`Romanian Tax Codes`: the codes, with the VAT rate, the kind of operation and the D300, D390 and D394 treatment of each code. This is global master data, shared by all companies."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:135
msgid ":guilabel:`Tax Mapping Rules`: rules that assign a tax code to an operation according to the tax, the type of document, the fiscal position, the location of the partner (Romania, EU, non-EU), the product category or a date range. They are used, for example, for the historic taxes at 19%, 9% and 5%, and for the VAT on payment taxes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:141
msgid "If a tax used in the period has no tax code and no rule, the declaration shows an error message and the operation is left out. Link the tax to a code, or create a rule, and compute the declaration again."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:148
msgid "Prepare a declaration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:150
msgid "All the declarations work in the same way. Open the declaration from :menuselection:`Accounting --> Romania (ANAF) --> Declarations` and click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:153
msgid "Choose the period. The :guilabel:`Period Type` is proposed from the :guilabel:`VAT Period` of the company, and the year and the period number from the last finished period. The form shows the dates of the period (:guilabel:`Period`) and the legal :guilabel:`Deadline`. The declarant data is copied from the company and can be changed on the declaration."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:157
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Compute`. The rows of the declaration are filled in from the posted journal items of the period, and the declaration moves to the :guilabel:`Computed` status. The local checks run at the same time and their findings are listed in the :guilabel:`Validation` tab."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:160
msgid "Review the rows and complete the data that cannot be computed from the accounting. Edited values are kept when the declaration is recomputed with :guilabel:`Recompute`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:162
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Validate`. Odoo runs the local checks again, builds the XML, checks it against the official XSD schema, and, if the DUK validator is configured, validates it with DUKIntegrator. If no finding is an error, the declaration moves to :guilabel:`Validated`; otherwise it stays :guilabel:`Computed`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:166
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Export XML`. The XML file is attached to the declaration and downloaded, and the declaration moves to :guilabel:`Exported`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:168
msgid "File the declaration with ANAF (see :ref:`localizations/romania/declarations/filing`), then click :guilabel:`Mark as Submitted`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:171
msgid "The XML file is named `<form>_<CUI>_<period>_v<version>.xml`, for example `D300_12345678_2026-01_v1.xml` (`2026-T1` for a quarter, `2026-S1` for a semester, `2026` for a year)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:175
msgid "Statuses and buttons"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:183
msgid ":guilabel:`Draft`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:184
msgid "The declaration is created but not computed. The period can still be changed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:185
msgid ":guilabel:`Computed`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:186
msgid "The rows are computed. Click :guilabel:`Recompute` after correcting the accounting, or :guilabel:`Validate` to check the declaration."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:188
msgid ":guilabel:`Validated`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:189
msgid "The validation found no error. :guilabel:`Revalidate` runs it again."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:190
msgid ":guilabel:`Exported`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:191
msgid "The XML file is generated. :guilabel:`Export XML Again` replaces the attached file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:192
msgid ":guilabel:`Submitted`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:193
msgid "You marked the declaration as filed. The :guilabel:`Submission Date` is set to today unless you filled it in, and the :guilabel:`Registration Number` received from ANAF can be entered in the :guilabel:`Validation` tab."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:196
msgid ":guilabel:`Archived`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:197
msgid "A declaration replaced by a later version, or archived with :guilabel:`Archive`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:199
msgid ":guilabel:`Reset to Draft` is available in the :guilabel:`Computed`, :guilabel:`Validated` and :guilabel:`Exported` statuses and deletes the computed content and the messages. Only declarations that are not yet exported can be deleted. A declaration of the same company, period type, period, declaration type and version cannot exist twice."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:205
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:526
msgid "Deadlines"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:207
msgid "The :guilabel:`Deadline` is computed from the end of the period. If it falls on a weekend or on a Romanian public holiday (calendar of the :doc:`localization base <base>`), it moves to the next working day."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:211
msgid "D300 and D390: the 25th of the month following the period."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:212
msgid "D394: the 30th of the month following the period."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:213
msgid "D101: the 25th of June of the following year."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:214
msgid "Annual financial statements: 150 days after the end of the year; half-year report: 45 days."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:219
msgid "A declaration that is exported, submitted or archived cannot be modified. To correct it, click :guilabel:`Create Rectificative` (:guilabel:`Create Corrected Declaration` in the D394). Odoo copies the declaration as a new version of the same period (:guilabel:`Declaration Type` :guilabel:`Rectificative`, :guilabel:`Version` + 1), linked to the declaration it corrects, and you compute, validate, export and file it like the first one. When the corrected version is marked as submitted, the previous versions are archived. The exact content of a rectificative depends on the declaration: see its page."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:228
msgid "Validation messages"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:230
msgid "The findings of the checks are saved as validation messages. The buttons :guilabel:`Errors` and :guilabel:`Warnings` at the top of the declaration open them, and :menuselection:`Accounting --> Romania (ANAF) --> Validation Messages` lists those of all the declarations, with filters on the severity and on the source of the message (:guilabel:`XSD`, :guilabel:`DUKIntegrator`, or the local checks). Each message has a code, the row concerned and, when it applies, the journal entry and the partner, to open them directly."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:237
msgid "An **error** blocks the validation. A **warning** does not: read it, and correct the accounting or the declaration if it is justified."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:243
msgid "Validation with DUKIntegrator"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:245
msgid "*DUKIntegrator* is the Java program with which ANAF checks the declarations before they are filed; it contains the official validation rules of each form. Odoo checks every XML against the XSD schema bundled with the module on its own, but the ANAF rules are stricter. Odoo therefore sends the XML to a small **DUK validator service**, which runs DUKIntegrator and returns the result. The service is shipped with the module in `addons/l10n_ro_declaration/tools/duk_service` and is installed separately from Odoo, on a server that can reach `static.anaf.ro`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:253
msgid "The ANAF programs (jar files) are not part of the module and are not redistributed: they are downloaded from the ANAF website with the script provided."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:257
msgid "What the validation checks"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:259
msgid "When you click :guilabel:`Validate`, Odoo runs three checks in this order and records the result in the :guilabel:`Validation` tab:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:262
msgid "The **local checks** of the declaration (company data, declarant, rules of the form, cross-checks with other declarations)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:264
msgid "The **XSD check** (:guilabel:`XSD Check`): :guilabel:`Valid`, :guilabel:`Invalid`, or :guilabel:`Schema missing`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:266
msgid "The **DUKIntegrator check** (:guilabel:`DUK Validation`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:272
msgid ":guilabel:`DUK Validation`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:274
msgid ":guilabel:`Valid`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:275
msgid "DUKIntegrator answered `ok`: it found no error and no warning. This is the result to expect before filing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:277
msgid ":guilabel:`Valid with warnings`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:278
msgid "DUKIntegrator reported only warnings (`W:`, `A:` or `I:` lines). The warnings are listed in the messages and do not block the validation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:280
msgid ":guilabel:`Errors`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:281
msgid "DUKIntegrator reported at least one error (`E:` or `F:` lines, or an unreadable result). The errors are listed in the messages and block the validation: correct them and click :guilabel:`Revalidate`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:284
msgid ":guilabel:`Not configured`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:285
msgid "No service URL is configured. The step is skipped, **without any message**, and the declaration can reach the :guilabel:`Validated` status without having been checked by ANAF's rules."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:288
msgid ":guilabel:`Service unavailable`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:289
msgid "The service did not answer, answered with an error (for example, the token is wrong), or DUKIntegrator could not run (for example, the validator of the form is not installed). Odoo records a warning, which does not block the validation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:294
msgid ":guilabel:`Validated` only means that Odoo found no error. If :guilabel:`DUK Validation` is :guilabel:`Not configured` or :guilabel:`Service unavailable`, the declaration has **not** been validated by DUKIntegrator. Install the service and make sure the status is :guilabel:`Valid` before filing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:299
msgid "When :guilabel:`Request DUK PDF` is ticked (the default), the service also returns the official PDF produced by ANAF's program, with the XML attached, if the validation succeeds. It is attached to the declaration as :guilabel:`DUK PDF`. The D101 and the financial statements are validated without the PDF: ANAF's PDF of these forms contains the annexes of the declaration (notes, reports), which are assembled with the ANAF assistance program."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:306
msgid "Install the DUK validator service"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:308
msgid "The service needs Java (OpenJDK 21 was used to verify it) and Python 3, and it is started with the files of ANAF in one folder (`DUK_HOME`). The module provides a `Dockerfile` that contains Java and Python."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:312
msgid "**Download the ANAF programs.** On a machine that can reach `static.anaf.ro`, run the script `download_duk.sh` of the service folder with the destination folder and the forms to validate:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:319
msgid "The script downloads `DUKIntegrator.jar`, its libraries, the configuration, and the validator and PDF jars of every requested form (`D300Validator.jar`, `D300Pdf.jar`...) from the update feed of ANAF (`versiuni.xml`). Request all the forms that you use; for example, add `D101`, `S1002`, `S1003`, `S1004` and `S1005` for the profit tax return and the financial statements. When `D406` is requested, the script also installs `DUKIntegrator_AnLunaUI.jar`, the period-aware validator used for the SAF-T file (see :doc:`saft_d406`). Run the script again when ANAF publishes new versions of the validators."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:326
msgid "**Choose a token.** The service **refuses to start without a token** (`DUK_TOKEN`), which Odoo sends as a bearer token. Use a long random secret. The `--insecure` option starts the service without a token and is only meant for private test machines."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:329
msgid "**Start the service.** For example, with Docker:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:337
msgid "Or directly on the server: `DUK_HOME=/srv/duk DUK_PORT=8080 DUK_TOKEN=<secret> python3 duk_service.py`. By default, the service listens on `127.0.0.1` only."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:339
msgid "**Check it.** `curl http://localhost:8080/health` answers `{\"status\": \"ok\"}`, and `curl -H \"Authorization: Bearer <secret>\" http://localhost:8080/info` lists the installed validators."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:343
msgid "Do not expose the service on the Internet. Publish the port on a private interface or a private network that only the Odoo server can reach, and keep the token secret."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:346
msgid "The service is configured with environment variables:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:352
msgid "Variable"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:355
msgid "`DUK_HOME`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:356
msgid "`/opt/duk`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:357
msgid "Folder with `DUKIntegrator.jar`, `lib/` and `config/`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:358
msgid "`DUK_TOKEN`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:359
msgid "none"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:360
msgid "Bearer token, mandatory unless the service is started with `--insecure`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:361
msgid "`DUK_BIND`, `DUK_PORT`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:362
msgid "`127.0.0.1`, `8080`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:363
msgid "Address and port of the service (`0.0.0.0` inside the Docker image)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:364
msgid "`DUK_TIMEOUT`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:365
msgid "`120`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:366
msgid "Seconds allowed for one validation. Raise it for large SAF-T files."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:367
msgid "`DUK_MAX_CONCURRENT`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:368
msgid "`2`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:369
msgid "Number of validations that run at the same time. A request that waits more than `DUK_QUEUE_TIMEOUT` seconds (60 by default) gets an HTTP 503 answer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:371
msgid "`DUK_MAX_BYTES`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:372
msgid "400 MB"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:373
msgid "Maximum size of the XML file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:374
msgid "`DUK_JAVA`, `DUK_JAVA_OPTS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:375
msgid "`java`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:376
msgid "Java executable and extra options, for example `-Xmx4g` for large SAF-T files."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:379
msgid "Connect Odoo to the service"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:381
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings`, section :guilabel:`Romanian ANAF Declarations`, setting :guilabel:`DUKIntegrator Validation`, and fill in:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:384
msgid ":guilabel:`DUK Validator Service URL`: the base URL of the service, for example `http://duk:8080`. Leave it empty to skip the ANAF validation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:386
msgid ":guilabel:`DUK Validator Service Token`: the `DUK_TOKEN` of the service. Only administrators see this field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:388
msgid ":guilabel:`Request DUK PDF`: tick it to receive the official PDF."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:390
msgid "Instead of configuring each company, the service can be set once for the database with the system parameters `l10n_ro_declaration.duk_service_url` and `l10n_ro_declaration.duk_service_token` (:ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>`, :menuselection:`Settings --> Technical --> Parameters --> System Parameters`). A company that has its own URL uses its own token; the token of the system parameter is only sent to the URL of the system parameter, never to a URL typed on a company. The parameters `l10n_ro_declaration.duk_service_timeout` (seconds, 120 by default) and `l10n_ro_declaration.duk_raw_threshold` (bytes, 20 MB by default; larger files are streamed to the service) can also be set."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:402
msgid "Filing with ANAF"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:404
msgid "Odoo prepares and checks the declarations, but it **does not send them to ANAF**: there is no connection to the ANAF filing services in the declaration modules. After the validation:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:407
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Export XML` and, if it was requested, open the :guilabel:`DUK PDF` in the :guilabel:`Validation` tab."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:409
msgid "File the declaration with ANAF yourself, for example through the *SPV* (*Spațiul Privat Virtual*, the private virtual space of the taxpayer on the ANAF portal), with the file that the portal requires for the form."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:412
msgid "Back in Odoo, click :guilabel:`Mark as Submitted`. Optionally, enter the :guilabel:`Submission Date` and the :guilabel:`Registration Number` (*număr de înregistrare*) that ANAF gave to the declaration. These two fields are informative: Odoo does not check them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/declarations.rst:417
msgid "The :doc:`e-Factura <e_factura>` integration, which sends invoices to the SPV, is a separate feature and does not file the declarations."
msgstr ""

