#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/e_factura.rst:3
msgid "E-Factura rules, deadlines and messages"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/e_factura.rst:5
msgid "The standard :ref:`E-Factura integration <localizations/romania/efactura>` sends the invoices to the ANAF *SPV*. Two eYssen modules complete it with the rules that Romanian companies have to follow every day:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/e_factura.rst:18
msgid "Invoices to individuals (B2C) and Law 88/2026, buyers identified by CNP, submission deadline of 5 working days with reminders, corrections as storno invoices, inbox of the SPV messages, check of the customer at ANAF before sending."
