#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/e_factura.rst:50
msgid ":guilabel:`B2C`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/e_factura.rst:51
msgid "The customer is an individual. The invoice is reported through the B2C channel, with the CNP of the buyer if it is known, otherwise with the code of 13 zeros (OUG 120/2021)."
