#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/e_factura.rst:67
msgid "To see the decision of the invoices, add the optional column :guilabel:`RO e-Factura Obligation` to the list of the invoices or group the invoices by :guilabel:`E-Factura Obligation`. For the individuals in the optional register and for the invoices that are not sent, a banner with the :guilabel:`RO e-Factura Decision` is displayed on the invoice."
