msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/e_factura.rst:89
msgid ":guilabel:`Issuer identified by CNP: Law 88/2026 exemption (PFA, II, IF)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/e_factura.rst:90
msgid "From 1 June 2026, the invoices to individuals are not sent, unless the customer is enrolled in the optional RO e-Factura register."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/e_factura.rst:94
msgid "Law 88/2026 (in force on 1 June 2026) exempts only the **issuers identified by their CNP** (individuals such as PFA, II or IF without a separate fiscal code). Companies (SRL, SA, ...) must keep reporting every B2C invoice, and unreported invoices are fined. Do **not** select the exemption for a company. Confirm the situation of the company with its accountant before changing this setting. A warning is displayed in the settings when the exemption is selected."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/e_factura.rst:100
msgid "With the exemption, the invoices dated on or after 1 June 2026 to individuals that are not in the optional register get the obligation :guilabel:`Not sent`. They are never uploaded to the SPV (the E-Factura option is not applied in :guilabel:`Send & Print`), and an information message lists them. The filter :guilabel:`Not Sent (CNP Issuer Exemption)` finds them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/e_factura.rst:105
msgid "To identify the buyer by CNP, fill in the :guilabel:`CNP` of the contact (see :ref:`localizations/romania/cnp`). To enroll an individual in the optional register, tick :guilabel:`RO e-Factura Register` in the :guilabel:`Romania - ANAF` group of the :guilabel:`Invoicing` tab of the contact (for an individual, this is set by hand)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/e_factura.rst:111
msgid "An earlier version of the module applied a wrong reading of Law 88/2026. When the module is upgraded, the companies on the former setting are reset to :guilabel:`Report every B2C invoice`, the invoices that had been marked as not sent are recomputed, and a warning listing them is logged. Select the exemption again if it applies to the company."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/e_factura.rst:119
msgid "Submission deadline"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/e_factura.rst:121
msgid "An invoice must be uploaded to RO e-Factura within **5 working days** of its issue date. The :guilabel:`E-Factura Deadline` field of the invoice (:guilabel:`E-Factura` tab, below the index) holds the last day: the invoice date plus 5 working days, without the weekends and the Romanian legal holidays (see :ref:`localizations/romania/calendar`). For the invoices issued until 31 December 2025, the deadline is 5 calendar days."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/e_factura.rst:127
msgid "The deadline is shown in orange when the invoice is *due soon* and in red when it is *overdue*, until ANAF accepts the invoice. The invoices that must be sent but are not validated yet can be followed in several places:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/e_factura.rst:131
msgid ":menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> E-Factura Deadlines (RO)` lists them with their deadline, the obligation and the status. The filters :guilabel:`E-Factura Pending`, :guilabel:`E-Factura Overdue` and :guilabel:`E-Factura Due in 2 Days` are available in the invoice lists as well."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/e_factura.rst:135
msgid "On the card of the sales journals of the :guilabel:`Accounting Dashboard`, the links :guilabel:`E-Factura Overdue` and :guilabel:`E-Factura Due Soon` show the number of invoices and open the list."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/e_factura.rst:138
msgid "A daily scheduled action, :guilabel:`E-Factura: Submission Deadline Reminders (RO)`, creates an :guilabel:`E-Factura Deadline` activity on every pending invoice that is due soon or overdue, with the deadline of the invoice as due date. It is assigned to the salesperson of the invoice, otherwise to the creator of the invoice, otherwise to the user who runs the action. When the deadline passes, the summary of the activity changes to *E-Factura overdue* and a note is posted in the chatter. The activity is closed with the feedback *Accepted by ANAF.* when the invoice is validated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/e_factura.rst:146
msgid "Set in :guilabel:`Deadline Reminder (working days)` how many working days before the deadline an invoice is *due soon* and the reminder is created (2 by default)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/e_factura.rst:152
msgid "Corrections: credit notes or storno invoices"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/e_factura.rst:154
msgid "The :guilabel:`Corrections` setting (:guilabel:`Corrections in RO e-Factura` field) chooses the XML document that is sent for a customer credit note. ANAF accepts both:"
