msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/e_factura.rst:158
msgid ":guilabel:`Storno invoice (Invoice 380 with negative quantities)`: the credit note is sent as an invoice (type 380) whose quantities, and so all its amounts, are negative, with positive unit prices. It references the number and the date of the corrected invoice."
