msgid "The SPV does not only answer to the uploads: it also sends the errors found in the invoices and the messages of the buyers. A daily scheduled action, :guilabel:`E-Factura: Store SPV Messages (RO)`, stores all the messages of each Romanian company that has an access token for the SPV (see :ref:`localizations/romania/efactura-spv`). In the :guilabel:`SPV Messages` setting:"
