msgid "Enable :guilabel:`Check Partner at ANAF before Sending` (:guilabel:`ANAF Check before Sending` setting) to check the customer when an invoice is sent. If the ANAF data of the customer was last refreshed more than :guilabel:`ANAF Data Maximum Age (days)` ago (30 by default), Odoo refreshes its VAT statuses (see :ref:`localizations/romania/anaf-partners`) and notes in the chatter of the invoice if the lookup failed or if the fiscal code is not in the ANAF register."
