#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/e_factura.rst:224
msgid "The check never blocks the sending. It warns when the customer is registered as an **inactive taxpayer** or applies the **split VAT payment** system (*plata defalcată a TVA*): a warning banner is displayed on the invoice, an alert in :guilabel:`Send & Print` with a link to the contact, and a note in the chatter. The :guilabel:`Inactive Taxpayer (RO)` and :guilabel:`Split VAT (RO)` fields of the contact give the status."
