#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/financial_statements.rst:7
msgid "The :guilabel:`Romania - Financial Statements (Situații financiare, ANAF)` (`l10n_ro_financial_statements`) module prepares the annual financial statements and the accounting reports of Romanian companies, forms **S1002**, **S1003**, **S1004** and **S1005**, and the half-year report **S1027**. The forms are computed from the accounting, checked with the official consistency rules of the ANAF structure, and exported as the XML files that ANAF defines for the financial statements of the 2025 financial year (**OMF 2036/2025**; the half-year report follows **OMF 1194/2025**)."
