msgid "The `l10n_ro_stock_account` module applies the Romanian stock accounting, and `l10n_ro_stock_report` prints the Romanian stock documents and reports. They apply to companies whose fiscal country is Romania, that have the anglo-saxon accounting disabled and that use storable products with an automatic (real-time) valuation."
