msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/inventory.rst:32
msgid "Books the non-chargeable VAT (4428) in the accruals of the receptions that have no vendor bill yet, and in the accruals of the deliveries with taxes applying VAT on payment (on by default). The output VAT of the other deliveries is always booked on 4427 at the delivery."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/inventory.rst:35
msgid ":guilabel:`Goods in Transit for Bills before Reception`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/inventory.rst:36
