msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/inventory.rst:44
msgid "Account managers can also set the accounts used for the accruals: :guilabel:`Invoices to Be Issued Account (418)`, :guilabel:`Non-chargeable Output VAT Account (4428)`, :guilabel:`Non-chargeable Input VAT Account (4428)`, :guilabel:`Inventory Surplus Income Account (7588)`, :guilabel:`Retail Markup Account (378)`, :guilabel:`Retail Non-chargeable VAT Account (4428)` and :guilabel:`Imputed Shortages Income Account (7581)`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/inventory.rst:50
msgid "Account managers can click :guilabel:`Configure Romanian stock categories`, below these accounts, to create, for the company, the Romanian product categories (for example goods 371, raw materials 301, auxiliary materials 3021, finished products 345, packaging 381), each with its stock, input (4081), output, expense and income accounts and its goods-in-transit account. The operation can be repeated safely: only the empty values are filled. It also creates the :guilabel:`Internal Consumption` location and one :guilabel:`Consumption Notes` operation type per warehouse."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/inventory.rst:58
msgid "When the module is updated on a database with one Romanian company, the Romanian categories are assigned to that company. With several Romanian companies, the shared categories stay global."
