msgid "On a location with :guilabel:`Retail at Sale Price`, the stock account (371) holds the goods at the sale price, including the markup (378) and the non-chargeable VAT (4428). The markup and the VAT are discharged at the sale, in the opposite direction. For example, for goods with a cost of 100 and a sale price of 200 plus 21% VAT (242), the reception books 371 +142 on top of the cost, with 378 -100 and 4428 -42."
