msgid "The module is installed automatically with :guilabel:`Romania - Localization Base` (`l10n_ro_base`, see :doc:`base`) and only changes the documents of companies whose **fiscal country** is Romania. The invoices of the other companies of the database, for example the Hungarian or Spanish ones, are printed as before."
