#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/nondeductible_vat.rst:3
msgid "Non-deductible VAT"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/nondeductible_vat.rst:5
msgid "Some purchases give no right, or only a limited right, to deduct the VAT: passenger cars (deduction limited to 50% by article 298 of the Fiscal Code), or goods and services that are not used for taxable operations (article 297). The :guilabel:`Romania - Non-deductible VAT` (`l10n_ro_nondeductible_vat`) module adds the purchase taxes and the fiscal position needed to record them, and makes sure that the non-deductible part is reported correctly in the :doc:`VAT return (D300) <d300>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/nondeductible_vat.rst:12
msgid "The module only creates its data for companies that use the Romanian chart of accounts (`ro`). It can be installed in a database that already contains Romanian companies: the taxes are then created for them at once."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/nondeductible_vat.rst:21
msgid "The Romanian chart of accounts (`l10n_ro`) already contains the *VAT 21% Non-deductible 50%* and *VAT 11% Non-deductible 50%* taxes (labels `21% ND 50%` and `11% ND 50%`), where the deductible half goes to the deductible VAT account and the non-deductible half is posted to account `6352`. The module adds the variants that the chart does not have. All of them are purchase taxes of the *Non-deductible VAT* tax group, with a 21% or an 11% rate."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/nondeductible_vat.rst:32
msgid "Deductible part"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/nondeductible_vat.rst:33
msgid "Non-deductible part"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/nondeductible_vat.rst:34
msgid "`21% Ded. 50% (cost)`, `11% Ded. 50% (cost)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/nondeductible_vat.rst:35
msgid "50%, to the deductible VAT account (`4426`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/nondeductible_vat.rst:36
msgid "50%, added to the cost: posted to the account of the invoice line (an expense or a fixed asset account), as OMFP 1802/2014 requires."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/nondeductible_vat.rst:38
msgid "`21% Non-deductible (cost)`, `11% Non-deductible (cost)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/nondeductible_vat.rst:39
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/nondeductible_vat.rst:42
msgid "None."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/nondeductible_vat.rst:40
msgid "100%, added to the cost: posted to the account of the invoice line."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/nondeductible_vat.rst:41
msgid "`21% Non-deductible (6352)`, `11% Non-deductible (6352)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/nondeductible_vat.rst:43
msgid "100%, posted to the account `6352`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/nondeductible_vat.rst:44
msgid "`21% ND 50%`, `11% ND 50%` (core `l10n_ro`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/nondeductible_vat.rst:45
msgid "50%, to the deductible VAT account."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/nondeductible_vat.rst:46
msgid "50%, posted to the account `6352`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/nondeductible_vat.rst:48
msgid "Use the tax that matches the accounting policy of the company: *(cost)* when the VAT of a vehicle or of an asset has to increase the value of the item, *(6352)* when it is booked as an expense."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/nondeductible_vat.rst:54
msgid "Fiscal position"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/nondeductible_vat.rst:56
msgid "The :guilabel:`Limited VAT deduction 50% (art. 298)` fiscal position replaces the standard deductible 21% and 11% purchase taxes with the `Ded. 50% (cost)` taxes. It is **not** applied automatically. To record a purchase of a vehicle, select it in the :guilabel:`Fiscal Position` field of the vendor bill (or of the purchase order) before you add the lines."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/nondeductible_vat.rst:62
msgid "Reporting in the D300"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/nondeductible_vat.rst:64
msgid "The VAT return reports the full amount of a purchase, deductible or not:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/nondeductible_vat.rst:66
msgid "the full base and the full VAT are reported in the purchase rows `24` (21%) and `25` (11%);"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/nondeductible_vat.rst:67
msgid "the non-deductible part of the VAT also carries the `ND - VAT` tax grid. It is shown in the memo line :guilabel:`ND - VAT - Non-deductible VAT included in rows 20-28 (art. 297-298 limitation, memo)` of the Romanian tax report, and it is subtracted from the row `31` (sub-total of the deducted VAT) and from the row `35` (total of the deducted VAT);"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/nondeductible_vat.rst:72
msgid "on credit notes, the signs of all the grids are reversed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/nondeductible_vat.rst:74
msgid "The tax lines of the non-deductible part are excluded from the tax closing entry, since they are posted to an expense or an asset account and not to a VAT account."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/nondeductible_vat.rst:83
msgid "Corrections of the core Romanian localization"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/nondeductible_vat.rst:85
msgid "The same release corrects three points of the standard `l10n_ro` module. The corrections are applied to the existing Romanian companies when the module is upgraded, without deleting or rewriting any posted journal item. They are listed in detail in the file :file:`addons/l10n_ro/EYSSEN_CHANGES.md` of the source code."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/nondeductible_vat.rst:91
msgid "VAT on collection taxes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/nondeductible_vat.rst:93
msgid "The *VAT on collection* taxes for 21%, 11% and 9% (article 3) had inverted signs on their tax grids, so that the VAT collected on payment appeared as a negative amount in the tax report. They now behave like the other sales taxes: positive on invoices and negative on credit notes. The journal items posted before the upgrade keep the grids they were posted with; the new signs apply to the entries created afterwards. The D300 amounts stay correct for both, because the :doc:`D300 <d300>` is computed from the tax codes of the taxes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/nondeductible_vat.rst:101
msgid "50% non-deductible taxes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/nondeductible_vat.rst:103
msgid "On `21% ND 50%` and `11% ND 50%`, only the deductible half carried the grid of the purchase row, so that rows `24` and `25` showed half of the VAT and row `31` was equal to row `30`. The non-deductible half now carries both the grid of the row and the `ND - VAT` grid, as described above. Entries posted before the upgrade have no `ND - VAT` grid, so the figures of the past periods do not change."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/nondeductible_vat.rst:110
msgid "Account types of contra-asset and deferred-income accounts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/nondeductible_vat.rst:112
msgid "The chart of accounts typed the depreciation accounts (`28x`), the impairment accounts (`29x`), the deferred investment subsidies (`475x`) and the deferred income from transferred assets (`478x`) as income or expense accounts. They are balance sheet accounts: with the former types, their balances appeared in the profit and loss report and were carried into the unallocated earnings, so that the balance sheet did not balance. They are now typed as non-current or fixed assets (`28x`, `29x`) and as current or non-current liabilities (`475x`, `478x`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/nondeductible_vat.rst:120
msgid "Accounts that you customized (a code that no longer starts with the code of the chart, or a type that you changed) are left untouched."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/nondeductible_vat.rst:122
msgid "Reports are computed from the account types at the time you run them. After the upgrade, the balance sheet of **past** periods therefore shows these accounts under their new types. Documents that you printed or filed earlier are not changed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/nondeductible_vat.rst:125
msgid "An account is **not** retyped if a posted entry has moved its balance to the result (an entry with a line on `121x` or `117x`), for example a manual year-end closing made while the account was typed as a profit and loss account. The upgrade logs a message starting with `l10n_ro 1.3` for each such account. Review these entries (normally reverse the part that closed the account to `121`), then set the account type yourself in :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Chart of Accounts`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/nondeductible_vat.rst:131
msgid "The Romanian :doc:`financial statements <financial_statements>` and the :doc:`SAF-T D406 <saft_d406>` work from the account numbers and are not affected by the types."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:3
msgid "SAF-T D406 (Romania)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:5
msgid "The *D406* informative declaration (*Declarația informativă D406 - Fișierul Standard de Control Fiscal*) is the Romanian version of the :abbr:`SAF-T (Standard Audit File for Tax)`. It is an XML file that contains the accounting data of a company (chart of accounts with balances, journal entries, invoices, payments and, depending on the variant, fixed assets or stock) and is filed with the :abbr:`ANAF (Agenția Națională de Administrare Fiscală, National Agency for Fiscal Administration)`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:12
msgid "The eYssen modules generate the file from the accounting data of Odoo, check it and prepare it for the upload to ANAF. They implement the ANAF schema version 2.4.9 and are aligned with the *DUKIntegrator* validator version J2.2.18 (February 2026)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:17
msgid "Odoo creates, checks and exports the file. It does not transmit it to ANAF: upload the exported file to the ANAF platform yourself, then record the submission in Odoo (see :ref:`Mark as submitted <localizations/romania/saft/submit>`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:26
msgid ":ref:`Install <general/install>` the modules of the variants you need to file. The *D406* module installs the declarations framework (:doc:`declarations`) as a dependency."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:38
msgid "The *General* variant (monthly or quarterly), including the simplified variant for non-resident companies, the ANAF nomenclatures and the mapping of accounts, taxes, partners and units."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:43
msgid "The yearly *Assets* variant. It is installed automatically when the *D406* module and the :doc:`Romanian fixed assets <fixed_assets>` module are installed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:47
msgid "The *Inventory* variant, filed on request of ANAF. It is installed automatically when the *D406* module and the Inventory valuation (`stock_account`) are installed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:50
msgid "If you create a declaration of a variant whose module is missing, Odoo refuses to generate it and tells you which module to install."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:56
msgid "The D406 variants"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:58
