#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:126
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings`. In the :guilabel:`Romanian ANAF Declarations` section, the :guilabel:`SAF-T (D406)` setting holds the company-level options:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:135
msgid ":guilabel:`SAF-T Tax Accounting Basis`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:136
msgid "The type of accounting and chart of accounts of the company, reported in the header of the file (`TaxAccountingBasis`). The default is `A` (commercial companies, OMFP 1802/2014). The other values are `I` (invoice accounting), `IFRS`, `BANK`, `INSURANCE`, `NORMA39`, `IFN`, `NORMA36`, `NORMA14`, `ONG`, `ONGE` and `BNR6`. The bundled ANAF chart used to map the accounts follows this choice for `A`, `IFRS`, `ONG` and `ONGE`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:141
msgid ":guilabel:`SAF-T Reporting Period`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:142
msgid ":guilabel:`Monthly` or :guilabel:`Quarterly`. It is the period of the general D406 and it follows the :guilabel:`VAT Period` of the company (monthly if the VAT period is monthly, quarterly otherwise). You can change it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:145
msgid ":guilabel:`Non-resident Registered for VAT`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:146
msgid "Tick it if the company is a non-resident registered for VAT in Romania. The general D406 is then the simplified variant (header comment `NL` or `NT`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:148
msgid ":guilabel:`SAF-T Tax Entity`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:149
msgid "Optional reference of the company, division or branch (`TaxEntity`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:150
msgid ":guilabel:`Report Accounts without Balance`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:151
msgid "Also reports the accounts that have no opening balance, no movement and no closing balance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:152
msgid ":guilabel:`Report Analytic Distribution`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:153
msgid "On by default. Reports the analytic distribution of the journal items (the analysis types and the analysis lines of the entries)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:155
msgid ":guilabel:`Maximum Compressed File Size (MB)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:156
msgid "500 by default, the limit of ANAF for one D406 form. A bigger declaration is split into several files (see :ref:`localizations/romania/saft/split`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:162
msgid "Map the accounting data to the SAF-T codes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:164
msgid "The SAF-T file uses its own codes for accounts, taxes, partners and units. The modules deduce them from your data, and let you override each of them. Check the result before the first filing: the validation reports the data that could not be mapped."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:180
msgid "Accounts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:169
msgid "Open an account (:menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Chart of Accounts`) and go to its :guilabel:`SAF-T (D406)` tab. It shows the reported values and the overrides:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:172
msgid ":guilabel:`SAF-T Account ID`: the number of the account in the file. If empty, the digits of the account code are used (`4111.01` becomes `411101`). It must be a non-zero integer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:174
msgid ":guilabel:`ANAF Standard Account`: the synthetic account of the ANAF chart. If empty, the longest synthetic account of the ANAF chart that starts the account number is used."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:176
msgid ":guilabel:`SAF-T Account Type`: :guilabel:`Activ (debit balance)`, :guilabel:`Pasiv (credit balance)` or :guilabel:`Bifunctional (debit or credit)`. If empty, the bifunctional accounts of the chart (for example 121, 4428 and 473) are recognized by their number, the contra-asset accounts (28x, 29x, 39x, 49x, 59x) are *Pasiv*, and the other accounts follow the Odoo account type."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:183
msgid "On a tax, the :guilabel:`SAF-T Tax Code` field sets the code explicitly. If it is empty, Odoo uses, in this order: the default of the chart of accounts template, the :guilabel:`Tax Mapping Rules` of the form D406 and the :guilabel:`Romanian Tax Codes` of the tax with the SAF-T codes defined by rate. Historic 19%, 9% and 5% taxes are mapped as well. Invoice lines without a tax are reported with the tax type `000`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:189
msgid "The rules and the tax codes are under :menuselection:`Accounting --> Romania (ANAF) --> Configuration`. The ANAF lists themselves (:guilabel:`Tax Codes`, :guilabel:`Tax Types`, :guilabel:`Standard Accounts`, :guilabel:`Units of Measure` and :guilabel:`Code Lists`) are in :menuselection:`Accounting --> Romania (ANAF) --> Configuration --> SAF-T Nomenclatures`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:195
msgid "On the :guilabel:`Invoicing` tab of a contact, the :guilabel:`SAF-T Identifier` field overrides the identifier of the customer or supplier. Otherwise Odoo builds it from the data of the commercial partner:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:203
msgid "Prefix"
msgstr ""

