msgid "`02`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:210
msgid "Company with a non-EU tax identifier: `02` + the identifier."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:211
msgid "`03`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:212
msgid "Individual with a CNP (personal numeric code): `03` + CNP."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:213
msgid "`04`, `05`, `06`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:214
msgid "Individuals without CNP and foreign companies without a VAT number: `04`, `05` or `06` + an internal code."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:216
msgid "`080000000000000`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:217
msgid "Unidentified retail customers (receivable lines without partner)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:225
msgid "Units and products"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:220
msgid "On a unit of measure, :guilabel:`SAF-T Unit of Measure` selects the code of the ANAF nomenclature (UN/ECE recommendation 20/21). If empty, the code is deduced from the standard Odoo unit, or `H87` (piece) otherwise. On the :guilabel:`Accounting` tab of a product, :guilabel:`NC Code (SAF-T)` holds the 8-digit Combined Nomenclature code. Fill it where the law requires it (imports and exports, intra-Community movements, reverse charge by NC code, excise goods); it is reported as `0` otherwise."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:228
msgid "On the :guilabel:`Advanced Settings` tab of a journal, the :guilabel:`SAF-T (D406)` group has two fields: :guilabel:`SAF-T Payment Mechanism` (by default `10` for cash journals and `42` for bank journals) and :guilabel:`Self-billing (SAF-T)`. Tick the latter on the purchase journal of self-billed invoices (*autofacturi*): the invoices of the journal are reported with the invoice type and the self-billing indicator `389`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:237
msgid "Generate and validate a declaration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:239
msgid "To create a declaration, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Romania (ANAF) --> Declarations --> SAF-T D406` and click :guilabel:`New`. The list only shows companies whose fiscal country is Romania."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:243
msgid "Select the :guilabel:`D406 Type`: :guilabel:`General (monthly / quarterly)`, :guilabel:`Assets (annual)` or :guilabel:`Inventory (on request)`. The :guilabel:`Assets` and :guilabel:`Inventory` types are only available if the matching module is installed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:246
msgid "Select the :guilabel:`Period Type`, the :guilabel:`Year` and the :guilabel:`Period`. The general variant is reported by month or quarter, the assets variant by year, and the inventory variant by month, quarter, semester or year."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:249
msgid "Check the :guilabel:`Tax Accounting Basis`, the :guilabel:`Header Comment` and, for a non-resident, the :guilabel:`Non-resident (simplified)` box."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:251
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Generate`. The declaration moves to :guilabel:`Computed`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:252
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Validate`. The declaration moves to :guilabel:`Validated`, or goes back to :guilabel:`Computed` if blocking errors are found."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:256
msgid "Generation is only possible if the company is Romanian (fiscal country) and its currency is the Romanian leu (RON). A company that is not in RON, or a Hungarian company, is refused."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:259
msgid ":guilabel:`Validate` runs three checks in order:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:261
msgid "The **local checks** on the accounting data (see the table below)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:262
msgid "The **XSD check** against the SAF-T schema bundled with the module (version 2.4.9)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:263
msgid "The **DUKIntegrator check**, run by the DUK validator service configured in :doc:`declarations`. If no service is configured, this check is skipped (the status is :guilabel:`Not configured`) and only the local and XSD checks apply. If the service cannot be reached, the status is :guilabel:`Service unavailable` and a warning is added."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:268
msgid "The results are listed in the :guilabel:`Validation` tab, with the :guilabel:`XSD Check` and :guilabel:`DUK Validation` statuses. The :guilabel:`Errors` and :guilabel:`Warnings` smart buttons open the message list. Errors block the export; warnings do not."
