#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:330
msgid "Once the declaration is :guilabel:`Validated`, click :guilabel:`Export XML`. The file is downloaded, and the declaration moves to :guilabel:`Exported`. Use :guilabel:`Export XML Again` to download it again."
