msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:334
msgid "Back in Odoo, click :guilabel:`Mark as Submitted`. The :guilabel:`Submission Date` is set to today if it is empty. Fill in the :guilabel:`Submission Date` and the :guilabel:`Registration Number` given by ANAF in the :guilabel:`Validation` tab."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:339
msgid "Odoo does not transmit the file to ANAF. :guilabel:`Mark as Submitted` only records that you did it."
