#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:342
msgid "The :guilabel:`Files` tab lists each file with its size and its XSD and DUK status, and lets you download it. If a DUK report was requested in the settings, the PDF is available there too. The file name is `D406_<CUI>_<period>_v<version>.xml`; for the assets and the inventory variants it starts with `D406_A_` and `D406_C_` respectively."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:350
msgid "Mark as submitted, archive and correct"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:352
msgid ":guilabel:`Mark as Submitted` is only available on an exported declaration. To correct a declaration that was already exported or submitted, click :guilabel:`Create Rectificative`. The new declaration is a full new version of the same type and period, and it is generated and validated as usual. You cannot create a rectificative while a newer version is still in progress."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:357
msgid "When the rectificative is marked as submitted, the older versions are archived. Use :guilabel:`Archive` to archive a declaration manually, and :guilabel:`Reset to Draft` to start over before submission."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:364
msgid "Large files"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:366
msgid "The file is generated in a streamed way, so big companies can be exported. If the compressed file exceeds the size limit (500 MB by default), the sub-sections are distributed over several files. A sub-section is never split, and each file has the full header with its position in the sequence (`_1of3`, `_2of3`, ...). A multi-file export is downloaded as a ZIP archive. If a single sub-section is bigger than the limit, an error is raised."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:373
msgid "What each variant exports"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:379
msgid "General (`l10n_ro_d406`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:376
msgid "The header, the master files (general ledger accounts, customers, suppliers, tax table, units of measure, analysis types, products), the general ledger entries of the period with the tax information, the source documents (sales invoices, purchase invoices and payments), and the opening and closing balances."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:383
msgid "Non-resident"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:382
msgid "If :guilabel:`Non-resident (simplified)` is ticked, the simplified file is generated. A non-resident can only file the general variant."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:399
msgid "Assets (`l10n_ro_d406_asset`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:386
msgid "Reported once a year, by 30 May of the following year (moved to the next working day if needed). It lists the purchase-type fixed assets that are running or closed, whose date is on or before the end of the year, and that were not disposed of before the year. The valuation is always the accounting one. The classification code comes from the HG 2139/2004 catalog (see :doc:`fixed_assets`). A warning (`ASSET_CATALOG`) is raised if the code is missing, and an error (`ASSET_ACCOUNT`) if the asset category has no asset account. The transactions are the acquisition (10, for the assets acquired in the year), the depreciation posted in the year (30) and the disposal."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:395
msgid "On the asset form, the :guilabel:`SAF-T (D406)` tab has the :guilabel:`Disposal Date (SAF-T)`, :guilabel:`Disposal Type (SAF-T)` and :guilabel:`Disposal Proceeds (SAF-T)` fields. The type and the proceeds appear once a disposal date is entered. The types are :guilabel:`Sale` (default), :guilabel:`Scrapping`, :guilabel:`Inventory shortage`, :guilabel:`Granted free of charge` and :guilabel:`Other`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:408
msgid "Inventory (`l10n_ro_d406_stock`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:402
msgid "Requested by ANAF; there is no fixed deadline. It lists the physical stock per warehouse and storable product (quantity, opening and closing value, stock account), the owners of third-party stock, and the movements of goods of the period from the done stock moves (purchase, production, sale, returns, consumption, internal, inventory adjustment, scrap and other). The document type is NIR, AVIZ or BON, and the document number is the NIR number if there is one. A warning (`STOCK_ACCOUNT`) is raised if the category of a product has no stock valuation account. See :doc:`inventory`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:411
msgid "Known limitations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:413
msgid "Payments: the settlement of invoices in other journals (for example a compensation made with a miscellaneous entry) is only reported in the general ledger."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:415
msgid "Inventory: the quantity of each warehouse is valued at the average unit cost of the valuation of the whole company. Stock owned by third parties is listed under the owners, but is not valued in the physical stock."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/saft_d406.rst:418
msgid "Assets: the disposals come from the SAF-T fields of the asset, since the standard asset module has no disposal date. Revaluations and transfers are reported as 0."
msgstr ""

