#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/statutory_registers.rst:91
msgid "General journal"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/statutory_registers.rst:93
msgid "The general journal (*registru jurnal*) lists the entries in chronological order, one row per entry, with the columns :guilabel:`Date`, :guilabel:`Document`, :guilabel:`Explanation`, :guilabel:`Debit Account`, :guilabel:`Credit Account`, :guilabel:`Debit Amount` and :guilabel:`Credit Amount`. You can unfold an entry to see its accounting lines. The report ends with a :guilabel:`Total` row."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/statutory_registers.rst:99
msgid "Account sheets"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/statutory_registers.rst:101
msgid "The account sheet (*fișa de cont*) starts with an :guilabel:`Opening balance` row. Each following row shows the date, the document, the explanation, the :guilabel:`Counterpart Account` (the first four, then `...`), the debit and credit amounts and the running balance. The sheet ends with a :guilabel:`Turnover and closing balance` row."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/statutory_registers.rst:109
msgid "The general ledger (*cartea mare*) shows, for each account, the opening balance, the turnover and the closing balance, each with a debit and a credit column. Unfold an account to see its monthly turnover."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/statutory_registers.rst:114
msgid "Sales and purchase journals"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/statutory_registers.rst:116
msgid "The sales and purchase journals have one row per document, with the date, the document number, the partner, the tax ID and the total of the document. Then the base and the VAT are split in columns by tax rate (21%, 11%, 9% and other rates)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/statutory_registers.rst:120
msgid "The sales journal also has columns for the intra-EU supplies of goods and services, the exempt operations (with or without the right of deduction, and not taxable), the domestic reverse charge, and the VAT on payment (*TVA la încasare*). The purchase journal has columns for the intra-EU acquisitions of goods, the services from abroad, the domestic reverse charge, the exempt or not taxable operations, and the VAT on payment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/statutory_registers.rst:126
msgid "The column of a tax is chosen according to its :doc:`D300 <d300>` tax tag. For old taxes without tag, the rate is used. Credit notes are shown with negative amounts. After the total line, the report adds a summary line for each D300 row (for example `D300 row 09`), so the column totals can be compared directly with the return."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/statutory_registers.rst:132
msgid "Inventory register"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/statutory_registers.rst:134
msgid "The inventory register (*registru inventar*) lists the balance sheet accounts (classes 1 to 5) at the end of the period, grouped by class. It has the columns :guilabel:`Book Value Debit`, :guilabel:`Book Value Credit`, :guilabel:`Inventory Value` and :guilabel:`Valuation Difference`. The inventory value starts equal to the book value, so the difference is 0. When the stock-taking shows a difference, book it in the accounting; it then appears in the register."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/statutory_registers.rst:141
msgid ":doc:`inventory` for the stock documents and :doc:`financial_statements`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/statutory_registers.rst:146
msgid "Click :guilabel:`XLSX` or :guilabel:`PDF` in the top bar to export the report. The export unfolds all the lines."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/romania/statutory_registers.rst:150
msgid "The trial balance and the same balance calculation are also the source of the :doc:`financial_statements` and of the :doc:`d101` return, so the figures are consistent."
msgstr ""

