#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:98
msgid ":guilabel:`1. Company`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:99
msgid ":guilabel:`Legal form` (:guilabel:`Self-employed (autónomo)`, :guilabel:`Limited company (S.L.)`, :guilabel:`Public limited company (S.A.)`, :guilabel:`Joint ownership (C.B.)` or :guilabel:`Other entity`), :guilabel:`Name / company name`, :guilabel:`NIF`, the address and the :guilabel:`Province`. Also :guilabel:`Check intra-EU VAT numbers (VIES)` (enabled by default) and :guilabel:`Spanish language and Madrid time zone`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:104
msgid "The NIF is checked (format and check character) against the legal form: a self-employed person needs a DNI or an NIE; the NIF of an S.L. starts with B, of an S.A. with A, and of a C.B. with E; :guilabel:`Other entity` cannot use the NIF of a natural person. The NIF is stored as the :guilabel:`Tax ID` of the company, with the ES prefix. The currency is set to euro if no chart of accounts is loaded yet."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:109
msgid ":guilabel:`2. Fiscal profile`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:110
msgid ":guilabel:`Fiscal profile` (:guilabel:`Self-employed (autónomo)` or :guilabel:`Company (S.L., S.A.)`), :guilabel:`SII taxpayer`, and :guilabel:`Install the modules of the profile now`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:113
msgid "See :ref:`localizations/spain/fiscal-profile`. The self-employed profile is refused for legal forms other than the self-employed person. When you continue, the missing modules are installed, the page reloads and the wizard resumes at the next step."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:116
msgid ":guilabel:`3. Tax regime`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:117
msgid ":guilabel:`Territory`, :guilabel:`Chart of accounts`, :guilabel:`VAT regime` and, for a self-employed person, :guilabel:`IRPF withholding on your invoices` (:guilabel:`15 %`, :guilabel:`7 % (new professional)` or :guilabel:`No withholding`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:120
msgid "Only :guilabel:`Common territory (AEAT)` is available: the Canary Islands and the Basque Country are not available yet, and Navarre is not supported. If no chart of accounts is loaded yet, this step loads the one you select (:guilabel:`PGC PYMES 2008`, :guilabel:`PGC 2008 (full)`, :guilabel:`PGC 2008 non-profit entities`, or one of the two cooperatives charts); afterwards the field is read-only. The :guilabel:`VAT regime` can be :guilabel:`General regime`, :guilabel:`Equivalence surcharge (recargo de equivalencia)`, :guilabel:`Agriculture, livestock and fishing (REAGYP)`, :guilabel:`Simplified regime (módulos)`, :guilabel:`General regime with VAT prorate` (you enter the :guilabel:`VAT prorate (%)`, greater than 0 and less than 100, applied from 1 January of the current year) or :guilabel:`Cash accounting (RECC)`, see :ref:`cash accounting regime <localizations/spain/cash-accounting>`. The regime is also sent to Veri*Factu as special VAT regime when it is the equivalence surcharge, REAGYP or the simplified regime."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:132
msgid ":guilabel:`4. Invoicing mode`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:133
msgid ":guilabel:`Veri*Factu`, :guilabel:`SII (immediate supply of information)` or :guilabel:`Decide later`. For Veri*Factu, the :guilabel:`Veri*Factu production mode` option."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:135
msgid "The step shows from which date Veri*Factu is mandatory for the company: 1 January 2027 for an S.L. or an S.A., and 1 July 2027 for the others. SII taxpayers are exempt. Choosing one mode turns the other off: a company cannot use the SII and Veri*Factu at the same time. The production mode is only available when the :ref:`production conditions <localizations/spain/veri-factu-production>` are met; otherwise the company stays in the AEAT test environment, and the step lists what is missing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:141
msgid ":guilabel:`5. Invoice series`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:142
msgid ":guilabel:`Invoice journal`, :guilabel:`Invoice series prefix`, :guilabel:`Separate series for corrective invoices` (enabled by default), and optionally :guilabel:`Separate series for simplified invoices (tickets)` with its prefix."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:145
msgid "The prefix is at most 5 characters (default :guilabel:`F`). Invoices are numbered per series and year, for example *F/2027/00001*; corrective invoices use the prefix preceded by R (*RF/2027/00001*). Once a journal has a posted invoice, its series can no longer be changed. The simplified series creates a sales journal :guilabel:`Simplified invoices` (default prefix :guilabel:`T`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:150
msgid ":guilabel:`6. Bank`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:151
msgid ":guilabel:`IBAN`, :guilabel:`Bank journal`, :guilabel:`Bank statements` (:guilabel:`Norma 43 / CAMT file`, :guilabel:`Online bank synchronisation` or :guilabel:`Manual`), and, depending on the installed modules, :guilabel:`SEPA creditor suffix`, :guilabel:`Confirming` and :guilabel:`Issued promissory notes (pagaré)`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:155
msgid "The IBAN is validated, and the bank is recognized for CaixaBank, Banco Santander, BBVA and Banco Sabadell. The bank account and the journal are created if needed. The SEPA creditor identifier is computed from the NIF and the three-character suffix agreed with the bank (default :guilabel:`000`). :guilabel:`Confirming` is offered for the banks that have a confirming file format installed, and uses the account 400100 :guilabel:`Suppliers, confirming`. :guilabel:`Issued promissory notes (pagaré)` uses an account 401 (trade bills payable). See :ref:`localizations/spain/promissory-notes`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:162
msgid ":guilabel:`7. Certificate`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:163
msgid "The AEAT certificate file (:file:`.p12` or :file:`.pfx`) and its password."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:164
msgid "The step is shown once the modules of the profile are installed. The wizard shows the holder, the NIF and the expiry date of the certificate, and warns if the certificate belongs to someone other than the company NIF (a representative or adviser certificate only works if authorized at the AEAT) or expires in 30 days or less. Expired certificates are refused. One upload stores the certificate for Veri*Factu and, when installed, for the other AEAT services (SII, check of contacts). A new certificate replaces the previous one. The password is not kept."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:171
msgid ":guilabel:`8. Tax advisor`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:172
msgid ":guilabel:`Tax advisor name` and :guilabel:`Tax advisor e-mail`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:173
msgid "Creates a user for the tax advisor (*gestoría*) with accounting access rights, or gives the access to an existing user with that e-mail, and sends an invitation e-mail. If the e-mail cannot be sent, the user is created anyway. If no contact e-mail of the AEAT declarations is set yet, this e-mail is used."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:177
msgid ":guilabel:`9. AEAT declarations`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:178
msgid ":guilabel:`AEAT journal`, :guilabel:`VAT counterpart account`, :guilabel:`Withholding counterpart account`, :guilabel:`Filing frequency` (:guilabel:`Quarterly` or :guilabel:`Monthly`) and the contact name, phone and e-mail."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:181
msgid "Shown once the AEAT modules of the profile are installed. These are the default values of the declarations, see :ref:`localizations/spain/aeat/configuration`."
msgstr ""

