msgid "Every step that you apply or skip is written to the setup log, available in :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Spain --> Setup log`: date, user, step, action (:guilabel:`Applied`, :guilabel:`Skipped` or :guilabel:`Finished`) and a summary of the values set."
