msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:758
msgid "When you update to a new version, keep the declaration of the version you replace: the AEAT expects the users of an invoicing system to conserve the declarations of the previous versions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:761
msgid "The declaration opens as a PDF (:file:`Declaracion_responsable_VeriFactu`), always in Spanish. It is generated from the declaration file that ships with each release (:file:`declarations/<version>.json` in the Veri*Factu module), which lists the producer, the system, the place and date, and the Veri*Factu modules and their versions. Releases have an identifier such as *18.0.es.4*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:768
msgid "If there is no published declaration for the version that is running, for example on a development version, the PDF is a **draft marked \"BORRADOR – SIN VALIDEZ\"** (draft, without validity) that lists the problems found. Do not give such a draft to customers or to the tax agency."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:778
msgid "The :guilabel:`Test Environment` option of the :guilabel:`Veri*Factu` section of the Accounting settings is enabled by default: the records are sent to the AEAT test servers. The production mode (sending real records to the AEAT) is only allowed when all of these conditions are met:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:782
msgid "the producer data is complete;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:783
msgid "the running code is an ES release (identifier :samp:`18.0.es.{N}`), not a development version;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:784
msgid "the responsible declaration of the running version exists and matches the data that is sent to the AEAT."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:787
msgid "As long as a condition is not met:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:789
msgid "the :guilabel:`Test Environment` option is read-only and a warning, :guilabel:`Production mode is not available`, lists the problems below the option. Records are still sent to the test servers, with the data shown in the section;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:792
