msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:795
msgid "accounting managers see a warning in the :ref:`pending records indicator <localizations/spain/veri-factu-pending>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:799
msgid "A company that already sent production records with an earlier version is not switched back to the test environment when the module is upgraded, but its records are not sent until the conditions above are met. A warning is written in the server log."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:806
msgid "Pending records and submission"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:808
msgid "A record is generated when an invoice is sent from the :guilabel:`Send` window or a point of sale order is paid, and it is sent to the AEAT afterwards. The AEAT imposes waiting times between submissions, and a submission can fail when the AEAT or the network is unavailable. A record that is not sent yet is *pending*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:813
msgid "A scheduled action, :guilabel:`Veri*Factu: Submit / Cancel Records`, retries the pending records **every hour**. On databases that were installed with an earlier version, the upgrade sets the hourly interval."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:816
msgid "A **paper plane icon** in the top bar (systray) shows the number of pending records on a red badge, for the users of the companies that have Billing access rights. It is refreshed every five minutes and is only shown when records are pending or a warning exists. Hover over it to see the details. Click it to open the list :guilabel:`Veri*Factu Records Pending Submission` (creation date, company, journal entry, document type, chain index and state)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:821
msgid "If the production conditions above are not met, accounting managers see the icon turn into a warning triangle. When there are no pending records, clicking it opens the Accounting settings."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:823
msgid "The same list is available in :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Veri*Factu (Spain) --> Pending Records`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:826
msgid "If a record is sent more than **240 seconds** after it was generated (for example because the AEAT was unavailable or Odoo was not running), it is sent flagged as an *incident* (*Incidencia = S*) automatically, so that the AEAT does not register it with error 2004. Nothing has to be done."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:833
msgid "`Ticket BAI <https://www.gipuzkoa.eus/es/web/ogasuna/ticketbai>`_ or **TBAI** is an e-Invoicing system used by the Basque government and its three provincial councils (Álava, Biscay, and Gipuzkoa)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:837
msgid "Odoo supports the **TicketBAI (TBAI)** electronic invoicing format for all three regions of the **Basque Country**. To enable **TicketBAI**, set your company's :guilabel:`Country` and :guilabel:`Tax ID` under :menuselection:`Settings --> General Settings` in the :guilabel:`Companies` section."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:842
msgid "Then, :ref:`install <general/install>` the module :guilabel:`Spain -TicketBAI (l10n_es_edi_TBAI)`, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings`, and select a **region** in the :guilabel:`Spain Localization` section's :guilabel:`Tax Agency for TBAI` field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:846
msgid "Once a region is selected, click :guilabel:`Manage certificates (SII/TicketBAI)`, then click :guilabel:`New`, upload the certificate, and enter the password provided by the tax agency."
