#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/aeat_declarations.rst:376
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> AEAT --> AEAT 193 Model`, click :guilabel:`New` and select the :guilabel:`Year`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/aeat_declarations.rst:378
msgid "Set the :guilabel:`Declarant Nature`. :guilabel:`Other declarant (not a paying agent, depositary or issuer)` is the usual case of a company that pays dividends or interest directly to its partners or lenders. :guilabel:`Paying agent, depositary, issuer or entity of art. 26.1.a) LIRPF` also shows the :guilabel:`Payment` and :guilabel:`Penalties` data of the records and the box :guilabel:`Withholdings paid in`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/aeat_declarations.rst:383
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Calculate`. There is one record per recipient, perception key and nature in the :guilabel:`Partner records` tab. A record shown in red misses its VAT number, its province code or a two-digit nature."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/aeat_declarations.rst:386
msgid "Review and correct the records, if needed: the VAT number and the province code (taken from the contact; :guilabel:`98` for a foreign contact), the nature, the :guilabel:`Perception Type` (:guilabel:`Monetary` or :guilabel:`In kind`) and, for the key A, the :guilabel:`Accrual Date` of the dividend (proposed as the last entry date; use the payment date of the distribution agreement)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/aeat_declarations.rst:391
msgid "Compare the :guilabel:`Withholdings` with the :guilabel:`Withholdings of the 123 returns` in the summary, which adds up the total of the 123 returns of the year that are not in draft or cancelled. Investigate any difference before confirming."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/aeat_declarations.rst:394
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Confirm`, then :guilabel:`Export to BOE`. The confirmation is refused while a record is incomplete."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/aeat_declarations.rst:406
msgid "Tick :guilabel:`Manual records` to keep the records when you recalculate, for example after correcting them by hand. Otherwise :guilabel:`Calculate` and :guilabel:`Recalculate` delete and recreate all the records, and your corrections are lost. Tick it after the first calculation: with the box ticked, :guilabel:`Calculate` creates no record."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/aeat_declarations.rst:410
msgid "The records can only be edited while the declaration is :guilabel:`Processed`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/aeat_declarations.rst:411
msgid "The nature and the perception key assigned to the *24% Withholding on capital* (key C, nature 06) must be checked for each case, as must the keys of any other tax mapped by hand."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/aeat_declarations.rst:413
msgid "The records of expenses of the depositary entities (art. 26.1.a) LIRPF) and the information on securities (ISIN code, securities account, securities loan) are not generated: they are exported with zeros or blanks, as is the distribution of the withholdings by tax administration."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/aeat_declarations.rst:418
msgid "The BOE file follows the record design of 2025 and later years: one declarant record and one recipient record per line of the :guilabel:`Partner records` tab, of 500 positions each."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/aeat_declarations.rst:424
msgid "Modelo 202: corporate income tax instalments"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/aeat_declarations.rst:426
msgid "The modelo 202 is the instalment payment (*pago fraccionado*) of the corporate income tax. There are three instalments per tax period:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/aeat_declarations.rst:434
msgid "Filed in"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/aeat_declarations.rst:435
msgid "Covers"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/aeat_declarations.rst:436
msgid "1P"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/aeat_declarations.rst:437
msgid "April"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/aeat_declarations.rst:438
