#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/aeat_declarations.rst:446
msgid "Two modalities exist, chosen in the :guilabel:`Modality` field, which can only be changed while the declaration is a draft:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/aeat_declarations.rst:449
msgid ":guilabel:`Art. 40.2 LIS: 18% of the last tax`: 18 % of the tax of the last tax period whose filing deadline has expired;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/aeat_declarations.rst:451
msgid ":guilabel:`Art. 40.3 LIS: result of the period`: the accounting result of the first months of the tax period, adjusted. It is mandatory for a company whose turnover of the 12 previous months is over 6 million euros: tick :guilabel:`Turnover over 6 million euros` and the first modality is refused."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/aeat_declarations.rst:458
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> AEAT --> AEAT 202 Model` and click :guilabel:`New`. The period is proposed from today's date: 1P from April to September, 2P in October and November, 3P in December, and the 3P of the previous year from January to March. :guilabel:`Start of the tax period` is proposed from the fiscal year of the company; correct it if the tax period started on another date."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/aeat_declarations.rst:463
msgid "In :guilabel:`Company data`, choose the :guilabel:`Modality` and fill in the data of the entity: the :guilabel:`CNAE` code, the :guilabel:`Corporate income tax rate (%)` (25 % by default), the :guilabel:`Turnover of the previous 12 months` band, and the boxes of the special regimes that apply, if any."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/aeat_declarations.rst:467
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Calculate`, then fill in the boxes below."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/aeat_declarations.rst:469
