#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/aeat_declarations.rst:477
msgid ":guilabel:`[04] Accounting result after taxes`: profit and loss accounts of the groups 6 and 7;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/aeat_declarations.rst:478
msgid ":guilabel:`[05]` and :guilabel:`[06]` corporate income tax, increases and decreases: accounts 630, 633 and 638;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/aeat_declarations.rst:480
msgid ":guilabel:`[28] Withholdings and payments on account`: debit balance of the accounts 473, without the entries of the 202 declarations;"
