msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/cash_accounting.rst:134
msgid "Deadline (accrual entry created by the scheduled action)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/cash_accounting.rst:135
msgid "105.00 € on a base of 500.00 € (account 477900 is now 0.00 €)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/cash_accounting.rst:138
msgid "Accrual on the deadline"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/cash_accounting.rst:140
msgid "The VAT that is still unpaid on **31 December of the year following the operation** becomes due anyway. The operation date is the invoice date. In the example above, the deadline of an invoice dated in 2025 is 31 December 2026."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/cash_accounting.rst:144
msgid "A daily scheduled action, :guilabel:`Spain: VAT accrual of the cash accounting regime (RECC)` (:menuselection:`Settings --> Technical --> Automation --> Scheduled Actions`, with the developer mode active), looks for the posted invoices of Spanish companies with unpaid or partially paid RECC VAT whose deadline has passed. For each of them it creates an entry in the tax cash basis journal:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/cash_accounting.rst:149
msgid "the entry is dated on the deadline, or on the first day after the lock date if the period is already locked;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/cash_accounting.rst:151
msgid "it mirrors the entry of a payment for the unpaid part of the invoice, and reports the base and the VAT with the same tax report tags;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/cash_accounting.rst:153
msgid "its reference is *<invoice> - VAT accrual on the deadline of the cash accounting regime*, and a message with a link to the entry is posted in the chatter of the invoice."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/cash_accounting.rst:156
msgid "Payments received after the deadline accrue nothing more: the VAT was already accrued. The scheduled action never accrues the same invoice twice."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/cash_accounting.rst:159
msgid "For purchases, the mechanism is the same: the input VAT of a vendor bill that is still unpaid on the deadline becomes deductible on that date."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/cash_accounting.rst:163
msgid "Invoice mention"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/cash_accounting.rst:165
msgid "The invoices of a company under the regime must state it. Customer invoices (and receipts) with at least one RECC tax carry the mention **Régimen especial del criterio de caja**:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/cash_accounting.rst:168
msgid "on the invoice form, as a badge in the title area;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/cash_accounting.rst:169
msgid "on the invoice PDF, above the payment terms."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/cash_accounting.rst:171
msgid "The mention is a legal text and is not translated. Vendor bills do not carry it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/cash_accounting.rst:184
msgid "Suppliers under the regime"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/cash_accounting.rst:186
msgid "If the company is under the general regime, it can only deduct the VAT of a supplier under the cash accounting regime when it pays the supplier's invoice. To handle this:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/cash_accounting.rst:189
msgid "Open the supplier's contact form and go to the :guilabel:`Invoicing` tab."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/cash_accounting.rst:190
msgid "Enable :guilabel:`Supplier in the Cash Accounting Regime (RECC)` (below the :guilabel:`Fiscal Position`). The field is only shown when the fiscal country of your company is Spain."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/cash_accounting.rst:193
msgid "Save."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/cash_accounting.rst:195
msgid "Vendor bills from this supplier are then posted with the purchase RECC taxes, so that the input VAT is deductible at the payment date, and at the latest on the deadline. The purchase RECC taxes are created and activated the first time they are needed. The company's own sales are not affected."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/cash_accounting.rst:200
msgid "The setting is shared by all the contacts of the same company: enabling it on a contact applies it to its company and to its other contacts. Ask the supplier which regime it applies."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/cash_accounting.rst:204
msgid "Effects on the declarations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/cash_accounting.rst:206
msgid "The AEAT declarations of the Accounting app take the regime into account, as long as they are installed (see :doc:`aeat_declarations`):"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/cash_accounting.rst:209
msgid "**Modelo 303**: the operations under the regime are reported when they accrue, in the boxes of their ordinary tax. Boxes [62]/[63] and [74]/[75] report the operations under the regime when they would have accrued under the general rule."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/cash_accounting.rst:212
msgid "**Modelo 390**: the VAT accrued in the year under the regime, including the accruals on 31 December of the following year, is reported in boxes [643] to [648] (4, 10 and 21 %) instead of the boxes of the ordinary regime."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/cash_accounting.rst:215
msgid "**Modelo 347**: the operations of a partner under the regime (company regime or supplier under the regime) are flagged, and the amounts accrued in the year under the regime are reported separately. The entries that accrue the VAT do not repeat the invoices in the annual amount."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/cash_accounting.rst:218
msgid "**VAT books**: each collection or payment of an invoice with VAT due on payment is recorded (date, amount, means of payment and bank account). The accrual entries are not booked as invoices."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/cash_accounting.rst:223
msgid "Gotchas"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/cash_accounting.rst:225
msgid "Enable the regime **before** posting the first invoice of the period it applies to: the taxes of the invoices that are already posted are not changed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/cash_accounting.rst:227
msgid "The RECC taxes are archived until the company opts for the regime (or buys from a supplier under it). Do not archive them again while the regime is in use: Odoo activates them again when it needs them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/cash_accounting.rst:230
msgid "The accrual on the deadline depends on the scheduled action: check that it is active if a deadline is missed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/cash_accounting.rst:232
msgid "If the accounting period of the deadline is already locked, the accrual entry is dated on the first day after the lock date, not on the deadline."
msgstr ""

