msgid "Enter a name, upload the certificate :guilabel:`File`, and enter a :guilabel:`Folder Name`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/sii.rst:45
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Obtain Keys`, enter the password of the certificate, and confirm with :guilabel:`Obtain Keys`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/sii.rst:47
msgid "Click :guilabel:`To Active` to use this certificate."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/sii.rst:50
msgid "The certificate is also used by the other AEAT web services, such as the check of contact data against the AEAT census."
