msgid ":guilabel:`SII Description Method`: how the description of the operation sent to the SII is built (:guilabel:`Automatic` from the invoice lines, :guilabel:`Fixed` text, or :guilabel:`Manual` on each invoice), optionally preceded by the :guilabel:`SII Customer header` or :guilabel:`SII Supplier header`;"
