#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain/sii.rst:108
msgid "If the sending failed, correct the invoice and click :guilabel:`Send to SII`. If a sent invoice is modified (for example, after resetting it to draft and confirming it again), the modification is sent again. To cancel a sent invoice in the SII, cancel the invoice, then click :guilabel:`Send cancellation to SII`."
