#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/redsys.rst:5
msgid "`Redsys <https://www.redsys.es/>`_ is the payment processor behind the virtual POS (:abbr:`TPV (Terminal Punto de Venta)` virtual) that most Spanish banks offer to their business customers. The **Redsys** payment provider lets your customers pay by card, or with `Bizum <https://bizum.es/>`_, on your eCommerce website and customer portal."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/redsys.rst:10
