msgid "A Redsys virtual POS contract with your bank, which provides you with a **merchant code** (also called :abbr:`FUC (Fábrica Unificada de Comercios)`), a **terminal** number, and a **secret key** (:dfn:`clave secreta de firma`) for each environment (test and production)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/redsys.rst:24
msgid "For :ref:`Bizum <payment_providers/redsys/bizum>`, Bizum must be enabled on your virtual POS by your bank."
msgstr ""

