#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/redsys.rst:37
msgid "the **merchant code** (FUC);"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/redsys.rst:38
msgid "the **terminal** number (usually ``1``);"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/redsys.rst:39
msgid "the **secret key** of the terminal (:dfn:`clave secreta de firma`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/redsys.rst:42
msgid "Odoo only accepts messages signed with the **HMAC_SHA512_V2** signature version. Make sure your terminal is configured to use it in the Redsys administration portal; if you do not know how, ask your bank. Messages signed with another version, such as ``HMAC_SHA256_V1``, are rejected (see :ref:`payment_providers/redsys/troubleshooting`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/redsys.rst:48
msgid "The URLs Redsys uses to report the payment result to Odoo (the online notification and the customer return URLs) are sent to Redsys with each payment request, so you do not need to enter them in the Redsys administration portal."
